<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="MRK" style="id">- Ndamba Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">MALIKU</para>
  <para style="toc1">Chilongu ngimu wuchiyandikiwili na Maliku</para>
  <para style="toc2">Maliku</para>
  <para style="toc3">Mlk</para>
  <para style="mt2">CHILONGU CHA NYANYI CHIYANDIKIWILI NA</para>
  <para style="mt1">MALIKU</para>
  <para style="imt">Ulongulelu</para>
  <para style="ip">Chilongu cha Nyanyi chiyandikiwili na Maliku ndi chitabu chimu gati ya fitabu mchechi fivelili mulilaghanu lya shonu fyeni fikuhimulila kwa chiganu ngalilu ya Yesu Kilistu. Kila chitabu chimu chikukemiwa “Injili,” mana yaki “Chilongu cha Nyanyi.” Fitabu afi fiyandikiwa chipindi Yesu pasovili kala, yivayandikili vavelili Mateyi na Maliku na Lukasi pamu na Yohani. Chilongu cha Nyanyi cha Maliku ndi chifupi gati ya Filongu fya Nyanyi fyosi mchechi. Kandi yimanyika kucha chitabu achi cha kwaa chiyandikiwa gati ya Filongu fya Nyanyi fyosi mchechi pamongapa gati ya milongu sita na muhanu mbaka milongu saba kukandila pasovili Yesu. Vasomi vatangalili vakumanya kucha chaveli chiyandikiwa kula Loma chayilatili kuvakola mawoku Valoma yivamjumilili Kilistu yivaveli kula.</para>
  <para style="ip">Wuwula wula Maliku amanyikili kwa litawa lingi Yohani Maliku, ayilongushili mumwanja na ndumindumi Pauli na Banabasi lakini lujumu lwaki lwayangilili nendu pala payibavili mumyanja yawu ya umishoni Figoli 13:13. Pambeli Maliku ayendili mwanja wumu na Banabasi Figoli sula ya 15:37-39. Maliku alolili kava mulyanja likomi na 1Petili 5:13 Hata leki Maliku aveli mtovileli wa mesu ng'odu mungalilu ya Yesu, vasomi vatangalili vamanyili kucha Maliku ayandikili chitabu achi kwa yila milandu yadetili Petili kwilata ngalilu ya Yesu na afi ndi chikandilu cha chitabu achi.</para>
  <para style="ip">Muchilongu cha Nyanyi Maliku akuvilishili wanachuli na ng'ulilu ya Yesu muchipindi cha mbelu.</para>
  <para style="iot">Yifivelili mugati kwa chikata,</para>
  <para style="io">Maliku akuchimanyisha chitabu Maliku1:1-13</para>
  <para style="io">Pambeli Maliku akuhimulila kwa chiganu ngimbaniku ya Yesu paghaveyi Galilaya musula ya 1:14-8:21</para>
  <para style="io">Kandi akutuwombela kwilata mwanja wa Yesu wa kuyenda Yelusalemu sula ya 8:22-10:52.</para>
  <para style="io">Maliku akumalilila kwa kuyandika milandu ya chipindi cha Yesu mu Yelusalemu pamu na kusova na kushukuka kwa Yesu sula ya 11:1-16:8.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Undumi wa Yohani Mbatisha</para>
  <para style="r">Mateyi 3:1-12, Lukasi 3:1-18, Yohani 1:19-28</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Achi ndi Chilongu cha Nyanyi cha Yesu Kilistu, Mwana wa Chapanga. Mayandiku vamu va dahili vavahela Mwana wa Chapanga. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Chakandili kucha wayandikili Isaya yaveli mbuyi wa Chapanga:</para>
  <para style="q">“Chapanga adetili, ‘Dandimlayishi makungu wangu akuwombeli,</para>
  <para style="q">dayakutandili deha yaku.’</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>Mundu yumu akukema kucheja,</para>
  <para style="q">‘Mugoli deha ya Bambu,</para>
  <para style="q">muhololi deha yaki!’ ”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>Topi Yohani mbatisha afumbukili kucheja, alandulili kucha vandu vapomeli sambi na kuvabatisha, kavawombela vandu, “Ili Chapanga avapomeli sambi shawu.” <verse number="5" style="v"/>Vandu vatangalili kufuma mlima wa Yudeya na mbwani ya Yelusalemu vayenda kumpikanisha Yohani. Vasipomela sambi shawu, mweni kavabatisha mulweni Yoludani.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Yohani mbatisha afwalili yingwa yavagolilili kwa mingoma ya ngamiya na lufunga lwa ngwembi muchiwunu chaki na alili ngumbingumbi na njuki ya mudasi. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Kavawombela vandu, “Akwisa mundu yaveli na liwovi kupita nenga. Nenga ngujakwa ha hata kugondama kuwopola ng'oyi sha mikobasi yaki. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Nenga nguvabatisha kwa machi, ila mweni daavabatishi kwa Mfuki Mng'alili.”</para>
  <para style="s">Kabatishiwa na kuyeshiwa kwa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">Mateyi 3:13-4:11, Lukasi 3:21-22, 4:1-13</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Majuva vala, Yesu afumili Nasaleti, kumlima wa Galilaya, kabatishiwa na Yohani mbatisha mulweni Yoludani. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Tepu pabwitukili mumachi, kawona kumbindi kwa Chapanga kufuwuka na Mfuki Mng'alili kamsunukila kucha njiva. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Na lishu lipikanika kufuma kumbindi, lideta “Yuwi mwana wangu yingutamili, mayiliwa na yuwi.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Tepu Mfuki Mng'alili kamugola ayendi kucheja, <verse number="13" style="v"/>aku ayikalili kwa majuva milongu mchechi payeshiwa na Lijangavandu. Vang'ongolu va mudasi vaveli pala, lakini vamakungu vayisa vamkimbanikila.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akuvakema vanachuli muchechi</para>
  <para style="r">Mateyi 4:12-22, Lukasi 4:14-15, 5:1-11</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Yohani mbatisha pavamtatilili kala muchijaka, Yesu ayendili mlima wa Galilaya kuvalandulila vandu Chilongu cha Nyanyi cha Chapanga. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Padeta, “Chipindi chifika, Wutwa wa kumbindi kwa Chapanga wuva pabehi! Mupomeli na muchijumili Chilongu cha Nyanyi!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Yesu patyangeyi muluwongu ya lihiva lya Galilaya, kavawona Simoni pamu na Andeleya mlongu mundu, pavafuva vasomba kwa lwafu.<figure style="fig" desc="" file="07 Fishing.jpg" size="span" loc="" copy="" ref="1:16">Mundu yafuva kwa lwafu</figure> <verse number="17" style="v"/>Yesu kavawombela, “Mungovikeli na nenga dandivagoli kuva vafuva vandu.” <verse number="18" style="v"/>Tepu vasileka njafu shawu, vamkovekela.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Paayendili pawulongolu padokwa, kavawona Yakobi na Yohani vana va Sebidayu, vayikala muwatu pavasambula njafu shawu. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Bahala pala, Yesu kavakema. Veni vamleka tati wawu Sebidayu na vala vagolafichuku va mula muwatu, vamkovekela Yesu.</para>
  <para style="s">Mundu aveli na chinyamkela</para>
  <para style="r">Lukasi 4:31-37</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Yesu na vanachuli vaki vayendili mumbwani ya Kapelinaumu. Palifikili Lijuva lya Kupumulila, Yesu kayingila Munyumba ya kudadavila kakanda kuwula. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Vandu vala vapikanishili ng'ulilu yaki vayikang'anika nendu, nongwa kavawula ha kucha vawula vawu va Malawu va Chapanga vamupili Musa, ila yaveli na uwesu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Bahala pala mundu yavelili na mfuki mwafu kayingila Munyumba ya kudadavila, kawuta kwa lishu likomi, <verse number="24" style="v"/>“Ukudayila kutugola liki, Yesu wa Nasaleti? Kwisa kutuyaghamisha? Ngumanya, Yuwi Mng'alili wa Chapanga!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>Yesu kamulakalila chinyamkela, “Matu! Kopoki kwa mundu ayu!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>Chinyamkela kamtaya chipwembu mundu yula, kawuta kwa lishu likomi, kakopoka kwa mundu yula. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Vandu vosi vayikanganika nendu, vakandili kwidasha, “Achi chindu liki? Ayi ng'ulilu ya shonu na uwesu? Mundu ayu akuwesha kuvalakalila finyamkela na veni vakumpikana!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>Filongu fya Yesu filopokesha kukwila kosi kumlima wa Galilaya.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akuvalowola vandu vatangalili</para>
  <para style="r">Mateyi 8:14-17, Lukasi 4:38-41</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>Tepu pavafumili Munyumba ya kudadavila, Yesu pamu na Yakobi na Yohani vanachuli vaki vayenda kaya ya Simoni na Andeleya. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Nafyala wa Simoni avelili kawonja pawulili akutamika. Yesu pafikili, bahala pala vamuwombela chilongu cha mawu ayu. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Topi Yesu kaselela kwa mawu yula mtami, kamkola liwoku kunu pamtandamusha. Utami umfuma mawu yula na mweni kakanda kuvakimbanikila.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>Lumihi palufikili na lijuva palidibili, vandu vamuyeghela Yesu vatami vosi na vandu yivavelili na finyamkela. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Vandu vosi va mbwani vayikungula paluvagha, <verse number="34" style="v"/>Yesu kavalowola vandu vatangalili yivavelili vakutamika matami va kila ndambu, kandi kafumisha finyamkela vatangalili. Kavagayila ng'odu finyamkela fwasi ya kuywanga, kwanongwa vamumanyili mweni ghani.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akudadava weka hela</para>
  <para style="r">Lukasi 4:42-44</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v"/>Chilawu yaki linyavagogolu, Yesu kayimuka, kawuka kaya kayenda pangajila vandu. Aku Yesu kamdadavila Chapanga. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Simoni na vayaki vayenda kumsaka. <verse number="37" style="v"/>Pavamuwonili vamuwombela, “Kila mundu akakusakeyi yuwi.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v"/>Yesu kavayangula, “Tuyendi fijiji fimonga fiveli pabehi, ngavalandulili vandu wuwula. Topi nyisa niyilata chichuku achi.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v"/>Naha katyanga mumlima wosi wa Galilaya, palandula Munyumba sha kudadavila na kuwusha finyamkela.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akumlowola mundu avelili na ukalava</para>
  <para style="r">Mateyi 8:1-4, Lukasi 5:12-16</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v"/>Mundu yavelili na ukalava amuyendilili Yesu kamtundamila na kamluva, kadeta, “Pawudayila, ukuwesha kung'ofuwa!”<note caller="d" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:40 Kwing'alisha: Ukalava wuva utami wumugola mundu ghavi mwafu.</char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v"/>Yesu amuwonilili lusungu, kaholosha liwoku lyaki, kamkamula. Pambeli kamuwombela, “Ngudayila ngutangi ung'ali!” <verse number="42" style="v"/>Bahala pala ukalava umfuma mundu yula, kang'ala.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v"/>Pambeli Yesu kamuwombela ayendi, kamkayika, <verse number="44" style="v"/>kamuwombela, “Pikanishi, ukotoo kumuwombela mundu yoyosi chilongu achi ila yendi ukayilangushi kwa mtambika. Pambeli uyeghi litambiku kwa Chapanga kucha alayilili mbuyi wa Chapanga Musa, vandu valoli utovileli kwa veni.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v"/>Lakini mundu yula kawuka kakanda kukwisha chilongu chila kosi, mbaka Yesu kalemwa kuyingila kumbwani kunu pawoneka. Ila kayikala panji, pangajila vandu. Lakini hata aku, vandu vamyendela kufuma mbembu shosi.</para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu akumlowola mundu yapombalili</para>
  <para style="r">Mateyi 9:1-8, Lukasi 5:17-26</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Pavapitili majuva vamu, Yesu kawuya Kapelinaumu na vandu vapikanila kava pakaya. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Vandu vatangalili vayikungasha hata fwasi yiva kwahela, vamema paluvagha losi. Yesu avelili akuvalandulila chilongu. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Vandu vamu, mchechi vamuyeghili mundu yumu yapombalili, vamuyeghela Yesu. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Kwanongwa vandu vaveli vatangala, valemwili kumuyegha mundu yula pala paveli Yesu. Topi vatobulili kulituvili, mwaveli Yesu. Pavatobulili kala lilanga, vamsunusha mundu yula yaveli kawonja muwulili. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Yesu pamuwonili ndambu ya ujumilwa wawu, kamuwombela mundu yula yapombalili, “Mwana wangu, ngupomela sambi shaku.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Vawuli vamonga va Malawu yivaveli vayikala pala vakaiholeyi ndima shawu. <verse number="7" style="v"/>“Akwidumba liki pawombeyi nawula? Akumjowola Chapanga! Kwa hela mundu yapomela sambi, ila Chapanga weka yaki.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>Bahala pala Yesu amanyili kala Chivayihola, avawombilili, “Wuli mbona mukwihola ndambu ayi mundima shenu?. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Choti chiveli chipusuka, kumuwombela mundu ayu yapombalili, ‘Kupomiliwa sambi shaku’, Awu kumuwombela, ‘Utoli ulili waku, witwiki yendi’?. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Ponopa ngudayila mumanyi, Mwana wa Mundu kana uwesu wa kuvapomela vandu sambi shawu pamulima.” Pala pamuwombilili mundu yula yapombalili, <verse number="11" style="v"/>“Ngukuwombela tandamuki, toli ulili waku na yendi kaya yaku!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Pala vandu vosi vaveli vakumlola, mundu yula kawoloka, katola ulili waki, kayenda. Vandu vosi vayikanganika, vamjuma Chapanga pavadeta, “Tukali hela kuchiwona chindu kucha achi!”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akumkema Lawi</para>
  <para style="r">Mateyi 9:9-13, Lukasi 5:27-32</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Yesu kayenda kandi muluwongu lwa lihiva. Lipinga lya vandu limkovekela, mweni kakanda kuvawula. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Papiteyi kamuwona Lawi mwana wa Alufayu kayikala muofisi ya vasumula mbiya ushulu. Yesu kamuwombela, “Ungovikeli.” Lawi katandamuka kamkovekela.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Pambeli Yesu aveli kayikala munyumba ya lawi akulya filivi. Vasumula mbiya vatangalili na vala yivavakema yivaveli na sambi vamkovikela, vayikala pamu na Yesu pamesa na vandundami vaki vakulya. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Vawuli vamonga va Malawu va Chapanga yivamupili Musa vaveli mulipinga vakulikema Vafwalisayu vamuwona Yesu paghalya pamu na vandu yivavakema yivaveli na sambi na vasumula mbiya. Vavadasha vanachuli vaki, “Wuli akulya pamu na vasumula mbiya sha ushulu na yivaveli na sambi?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Yesu kavapikanisha kavawombela, “Vandu yivaveli na njimba nofu vakudayila ha mwilwana, yivadayila mwilwana vala yivaveli vatami. Nenga nyisa kuvakema vandu yivayihola veni goleki ha, ila yivaveli na sambi.”</para>
  <para style="s">Kwikaja kulya</para>
  <para style="r">Mateyi 9:14-17, Lukasi 5:33-39</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Chipindi chimu vanachuli va Yohani mbatisha na vanachuli va Vafwalisayu vaveli vakwikaja kulya. Vandu vamonga vayisa kumdasha Yesu. “Wuli vanachuli va Yohani na va Vafwalisayu vakwikaja kulya lakini vanachuli vaku vakwikaja ha kulya?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Yesu kavayangula, “Wuli vavalalikili kulihungu lya kuheta mkuvadayila vayikaji kulya chipindi vava pamu na Bambu wa lihungu lya kuheta vaweshi ng'odu kuyikaja kulya. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Lakini chipindi dachiyisi Bambu wa lihungu lya kuheta davamuwushi pala pavayikaleyi pamu, chipindi achi davayikaji kulya.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>“Vandu vakudumula ha chipapi cha shonu na kusonela muyingwa ngulungulu. Mani pavagola naha, achi chipapi dachinyopoli yingwa ngulungulu, yeni dayidemuki nendu. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Vandu vakutayaya ha difwayi ya shonu mumihaku ya ngwembi yadahili. Pavagola naha, difwayi daubaluli ayi mihaku ya ngwembi, difwayi na mihaku dayidanganyiki. Difwayi ya shonu vakutaya mumihaku ya ngwembi ya shonu.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akuwula kwilata Lijuva lya Kupumulila</para>
  <para style="r">Mateyi 12:1-8, Lukasi 6:1-5</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Lijuva lya Kupumulila, Yesu aveli papita mufitava fya mupunga. Paghaveyi akupita, vanachuli vaki vakanda kudumula misasa ya fivelekwa. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Vafwalisayu vamuwombela, “Loli! Wuli vakugola chindu chikaniwili Lijuva lya Kupumulila?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>Yesu kavayangula, “Mukali hela kusoma fyagolili Dawudi pamu na vamonga chipindi pavaveghi na njala? <verse number="26" style="v"/>Mumajuva va mtambika mkomi Abyatali, Dawudi ayingilili munyumba ya Chapanga na kulya mibumunda yivikiliwi kwa Chapanga. Chindu achi chigoleka chipindi cha Abyatali aveli mtambika mkomi wa Chapanga. Nayiva vatambika weka yau yivaveli vajumiliwa kulya mibumunda yila. Lakini Dawudi kalya na kavagayila na vayaki.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>Pambeli Yesu kavawombela, “Lijuva lya Kupumulila livikiwa kuvatanga vandu. ila vandu kwanongwa ya Lijuva lya Kupumulila ha! <verse number="28" style="v"/>Nenga mwana wa Mundu ndiva Bambu hata kwa Lijuva lya Kupumulila.”</para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu akumlowola mundu yapombalili liwoku</para>
  <para style="r">Mateyi 12:9-14, Lukasi 6:6-11</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Pambeli Yesu kayenda kandi Munyumba ya kudadavila. Amu kwavelili na mundu yavelili na liwoku lipombalili. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Vandu vamu vavelili mula vaveli vakumsakila nongwa ya kumhigha. Ponopa vamlolela kucha angamlowulili Lijuva lya kupumulila. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Yesu kamuwombela mundu ayu yapombalili liwoku, “Wisi apa.” <verse number="4" style="v"/>Pambeli kavadasha, “Wuli malawu vetu vakutujumisha kugola liki mulijuva lya kupumulila? Kugola findu fya nyanyi awu fya wafu, kumlowola mundu akotoo kusova awu kumuwulagha?”</para>
  <para style="p">Lakini veni vayangulili chindu ha. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Apa kavalola vosi kwa maya, kunu kavawonela lusungu ndambu ndima shawu sikamalili, Pambeli kamuwombela mundu yula, “Holoshi liwoku lyaku!” Mweni kaholosha liwoku lyaki, bahala pala liwoku lyaki liva kandi linofu. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Tepu Vafwalisayu vafumili panji ya Nyumba ya kudadavila, vakawombaneyi pamu na lipinga lidokwa lya vandu va Helodi, vakasakeyi ndambu ya kumuwulagha Yesu.</para>
  <para style="s">Lipinga lya vandu limkovekela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Yesu kawuka pala pamu na vanachuli vaki, ayendili muluwongu ya lihiva lya Galilaya, lipinga lya vandu lyamkovikelili. Vandu vala vafumili milima ya Yelusalemu na Yudeya, <verse number="8" style="v"/>pamu na Yelusalemu na Idume na kumwambu ya lweni Yoludani, mbwani ya Tilu na Sidoni. Vandu ava vatangalili vamyendela Yesu, kwanongwa vapikanishili findu fitangalili fyagolili. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Lipinga lya vandu lyaveli likomi mbaka Yesu avawombilili vanachuli vaki vamvikili watu wumu, ili lipinga lya vandu likotoo kumfwasha. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Aveli kavalowola vandu vatangalili na vosi vaveli vatami vakalevanileyi vamugufyi Yesu. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Vandu vavelili na finyamkela pavamuwonili, vawili pawulongolu yaki, pavawuta, “Yuwi kuva Mwana wa Chapanga!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Lakini Yesu, kavakanila vakotoo kuvawombela vandu mweni ghani.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akuvashawula vandundami vaki lilongu na vavili</para>
  <para style="r">Mateyi 10:1-4, Lukasi 6:12-16</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Yesu kakwela kuchidunda kavakema vala avadayilili mweni, topi vamyendela, <verse number="14" style="v"/>mweni kavashawula vandu lilongu na vavili avakemili vandundami. Kavawombela, “Ndivashawula yumwi kuva na nenga, dandivalayishi kuyenda kuvalandulila vandu, <verse number="15" style="v"/>damuvi na uwesu wa kuwusha finyamkela.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Ava lilongu na vavili yavashawulili vaveli Simoni, Yesu amkemili Petili, <verse number="17" style="v"/>Yakobi na Yohani vana va Sebidayu Yesu avakemili Bowaneligi, mana yaki “Vandu va kuwumba”, <verse number="18" style="v"/>Andeleya na Filipu na Batulumeyu na Mateyi na Tomasi na Yakobi mwana va Alufayu na Tadeyu na Simoni yayitashila mlima. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Yudasi Sikaliyoti, yula yamushengitili Yesu.</para>
  <para style="s">Uwesu wa Yesu ufuma kwa ghani</para>
  <para style="r">Mateyi 12:22-32, Lukasi 11:14-23, 12:10</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Pambeli Yesu kayenda kaya. Vandu vatangalili vatangana kandi mbaka Yesu na vanachuli vaki vawesha ha kulya filivi. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Valongu vaki pavapikanishili naha, vayenda kumtola, kwanongwa vandu vakacheyi, “Yesu kajumba lisini.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Vawula va Malawu vafumili Yelusalemu vadeta, “Ayu aveli na Besibuli! Ndi mkomi wa finyamkela yamgayila uwesu wa kuvafumisha finyamkela.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Yesu kavakema na kuvawombela kwa filangushilu, “Yikuweshikana wuliwuli Lijangavandu amfumishi Lijangavandu mumonga? <verse number="24" style="v"/>Kucha wutwa pawitapula weni kuva fipinga na kwitova, wutwa awu dawuwi. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Na leki kaya payitapula fipinga fipinga, kaya asi dasiwi. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Kucha naha, wutwa wa Lijangavandu weni pawitapula, dawuwi na kufika mwishu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>“Kwahela mundu yawesha kwingila munyumba ya mundu muna liwovi na kufitola findu fya mundu ayu, ngajila kuwopiwa tanila mundu ayu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>“Nguvawombela nakaka, vandu davawushiwi sambi shawu shosi na majowolu vawu vosi kwa Chapanga. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Lakini mundu yoyosi yamjowola Mfuki Mng'alili, ayu dapomiliwi ha, kwanongwa kagola sambi ya jola.” <verse number="30" style="v"/>Yesu adetili nahawu kwanongwa vandu vadetili, “Yesu kana finyamkela.”</para>
  <para style="s">Mau na valongu va Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">Mateyi 12:46-50, Lukasi 8:19-21</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>Pambeli mau na valongumundu Yesu vayisa. Vawoloka panji, vamlayisha mundu ayingili munyumba akamkemi. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Lipinga likomi lya vandu lyaveli limshengetela pavampikanisha Yesu. Veni vamuwombela, “Mau waku na valongu vaku vava panji vakukusaka yuwi.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v"/>Yesu kavayangula, “Mau wangu na valongu vangu vaghani?” <verse number="34" style="v"/>Pambeli kavalola vandu vamshengitilili na kadeta, “Mloli! Ava ndi mau wangu na valongu vangu! <verse number="35" style="v"/>Mundu yoyosi yagola ndambu yadayila Chapanga, ayu ndi mau wangu, mlongu wangu na mhaja wangu.”</para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Chilangushilu cha mundu yakweta</para>
  <para style="r">Mateyi 13:1-9, Lukasi 8:4-8</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Yesu kakanda kandi kuwula muluwongu ya lihiva lya Galilaya. Lipinga likomi lya vandu limshengitilili lyaveli likomi, mbaka kayipaka muwatu na kuyikala amu na vandu vosi vaikala muluwongu lwa lihiva. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Kavawula filongu fitangalili kwa filangushilu avawombilili,</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>“Mpikanishi! Mundu yakweta ayendili kukweta mbeyu. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Paghaveyi akukweta mbeyu, simonga shaponikili mudeha, vambongu vayisa valya. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Simonga shaponikili muuganga wuveli na migonguveli gonguveli. Mbeyu asi simela kalopu nongwa miganga midokwa. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Lakini palifumili lijuva, liyumisha muhali kwanongwa mikigha yaki iyenda ha pasi. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Simonga shaponikili mumisomi, misomi yikula, yikekeneka muhali, kwanongwa ayi silela ha. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Lakini simonga shaponikili muwuganga wa nyanyi. Simela, sikula na kulela fivelekwa, simonga shiyongesheka selu ndatu, simonga selu sita na simonga selu mya!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Pamalilili Yesu kavawombela, “Mundu yeveli na majeji va kupikanishila, apikani!”</para>
  <para style="s">Kuhimulila filangushilu</para>
  <para style="r">Mateyi 13:10-17, Lukasi 8:9-10</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Yesu paghaveyi weka hela, vandu vamu vaveli vakumpikanisha pamu na vanachuli vaki lilongu na vavili vamdasha avahimulili filangushilu afi. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Yesu kavawombela, “Yumwi mgayiliwa mbwepu sha Wutwa wa kumbindi kwa Chapanga, lakini vamonga, vakuwombiwa kila chindu kwa chilangushilu, <verse number="12" style="v"/>ili,</para>
  <para style="q">‘Pavalola valoli, lakini vakotoo kuwona,</para>
  <para style="q">pavapikana vapikani, lakini vakotoo kumanya,</para>
  <para style="q">Kwa nongwa kucha pavamanya, vakuwesha kumuwuyila Chapanga,</para>
  <para style="q">na mweni akuwesha kuvapomela sambi shawu.’ ”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akuhimulila unofu mana ya chilangushilu cha mundu yakweta</para>
  <para style="r">Mateyi 13:18-23, Lukasi 8:11-15</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Pambeli Yesu kavadasha, “Mumanya ng'odu mana ya chilangushilu achi? Ponopa damumanyi wuliwuli filangushilu fimonga? <verse number="14" style="v"/>Mbeyu yikwetiwili ndi chilongu cha Chapanga. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Vandu vamonga yavafumbukili kucha mbeyu siponikilili mudeha. Pavapikanisha chilongu cha Chapanga, bahala pala Lijangavandu akwisa akuchitola chilongu mundima shawu. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Vandu vamonga vafumbukili kucha mbeyu siponikilili muuganga wuveli na migonguveli gonguveli. Pavapikana chilongu bahala pala vakuchiyanga kunu pavachinemelela. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Lakini chilongu achi chikuyingila ha mugati topi vayendelela padokwa. Msayisayi na sida pasiyisa kwanongwa ya chilongu, bahala pala vakuleka kujumila. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Vandu vamonga vakwifwana na mbeyu siponikilili pa mibiki ya misomi. Ava ndi vandu vapikana chilongu, <verse number="19" style="v"/>ila chipwembwi cha ngalilu ayi, kudayila unayiza na kudayila findu fya ndambu shosi, fikuvayingila na kuchikekeneka chilongu na vandu ava vakulela ha vivelekwa. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Lakini vandu vamonga vakwifwana na mbeyu siponikilili muwuganga wa nyanyi. Ava vakuchipikana chilongu, vakuchijumila na kulela fivelekwa, vamonga myanja mitatu, vamonga myanja sita na vamonga myanja mya.”</para>
  <para style="s">Chibatali chigubikiwili.</para>
  <para style="r">Lukasi 8:16-18</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Yesu kayendelela kuvawombela, “Kuna mundu yagubika luliku kwa chiyungu? Awu akuluvika pachindangawala? <verse number="22" style="v"/>Kila chindu chifisiwili dachivi lipala na chochosi chigubikiwili dachigubutuliwi. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Mundu muna majeji va kupikanishila, apikani!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>Yesu kavawombela kandi, “Mloli unofu fila fimpikana! Chigelu chichila chimuvapimila vayenu, Chapanga na mweni davapimili chigelu chichila yumwi, kandi na kuvayongishela. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Mundu yaveli na chindu dayongishewi na mundu yangajila chindu, hata chidokwa chaveli nachu, dapokiwi.”</para>
  <para style="s">Chilangushilu cha mbeyu yimelili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>Yesu kayendilela kudeta, “Wutwa wa kumbindi kwa Chapanga ukwifwana ndambu ayi. Mundu mumonga akukweta mbeyu kufitava. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Pamihi akuwonja ng'onju, pamusi kava mesu, chipindi achi mbeyu sila sikumela na kukula. Mweni kamanya ng'odu ndambu pasimela na kukula. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Uganga weni ukuwugola muhali ukuli na kulela, likutala kutomola mihamba, kandi ndulu, pambeli ukuyela. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Mbeyu, fivelekwa pafikomala, bahala pala mundu ayu akukanda kubena, kwanongwa chipindi cha mbena chifika.” <figure style="fig" desc="" file="12 Sickle.jpg" size="col" loc="" copy="" ref="4:29">Mundu yabena kwa chimayi</figure></para>
  <para style="s">Chilangushilu cha mbeyu dokwa nendu</para>
  <para style="r">Mateyi 13:31-32,34, Lukasi 13:18-19</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v"/>Yesu kadasha kandi, “Wutwa wa kumbindi kwa Chapanga ukuyifwana na chindu liki? Tutoli chilangushilu liki kuwuhimulila? <verse number="31" style="v"/>Ukuyifwana na mbeyu dokwa, mbeyu dokwa nendu pitu shosi sikwetiwa mufitava. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Lakini pasikwetiwa, sikukula na kuva libiki likomi pitu mibiki yosi ya mufitava. Kandi likuva na mitafyi mikomi mbaka vambongu vakuwesha kugola fiyumba fyawu mumitafyi ayi.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v"/>Yesu kavalandulila vandu chilongu chaki kwa filangushilu fingi fitangalili fya ndambu ayi. Kaywanga nawu ndambu pavaweshili kufimanya. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Kaywanga nawu chindu chochosi ha ngajila kutola chilangushilu Lakini paghaveyi na vanachuli vaki weka yawu, avawombilili mana ya kila chilangushilu.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akulakalila liwumbula</para>
  <para style="r">Mateyi 8:23-27, Lukasi 8:22-25</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v"/>Lumihi lijuva lilila lila, Yesu kavawombela vanachuli vaki, “Tujabuki, tuyendi kumwambu ya lihiva.” <verse number="36" style="v"/>Topi valileka lipinga lya vandu. Vanachuli vayingila muwatu mwayipakili Yesu na vawuka pamu. Kwaveli na matu vamonga. <verse number="37" style="v"/>Bahala pala, liyisa liwumbula na majinga vakanda kutova watu mbaka machi vakanda kumema muwatu wula.<figure style="fig" desc="" file="09 Boat in Storm.jpg" size="col" loc="" copy="" ref="4:37">Watu wutang'ana na liwumbula na majinga</figure> <verse number="38" style="v"/>Yesu aveli kumbeli muwatu kasaghamila musahamu. Vanachuli vamuyimusha, vamuwombela, “Muwula, ukulola ng'odu ndambu yitumilwa?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v"/>Yesu kayimuka, kalilakalila liwumbula lila na kavawombela majinga, “Nyamali jii!” Liwumbula linyamala na kulindivala jii. <verse number="40" style="v"/>Pambeli Yesu kavawombela, “Mukutila liki? Mukali muvahela ujumilwa?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v"/>Na veni vatila nendu na vayidasha veni, “Ayu mundu wa ndambu liki? Hata liwumbula na majinga fyosi fikumjumila!”</para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu akumlowola mundu yaveli na finyamkela</para>
  <para style="r">Mateyi 8:28-34, Lukasi 8:26-39</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Yesu na vanachuli vaki vajabuka kumwambu ya lihiva lya Galilaya, mumlima wa Vagelasi. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Tepu Yesu pajabukili muwatu, katang'ana na mundu yafumbukili kumbaku siveli kusembi muna finyamkela. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Mundu ayu aveli akwikala kumbaku siveli kusembi na kwahela mundu yaweshili kumuwopa kandi hata kwa lingongola, <verse number="4" style="v"/>myanja yitangalili aveli pawopiwa mawoku na mawulu, lakini aveli padumula lingongola na akuketula ng'oyi shawopiwili. Na kwahela mundu yavelili na liwovi lya kumkamula. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Majuva vosi aveli payenda-yenda kusembi na kufidunda, pawuta na kuyikesa-kesa kwa migonguveli.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Pamuwonili Yesu kutali, kamtuvilila na kumtundamila. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Kawuta kwa lishu likomi na kudeta, “Yesu, Mwana wa Chapanga yaveli kumbindi nendu! Ukudayila liki kwa nenga? Wilapi kwa litawa lya Chapanga, ngukudadava ukotoo kugobola!” <verse number="8" style="v"/>Adetili naha kwanongwa Yesu adetili, “Yuwi chinyamkela, umfumi mundu ayu!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Pambeli Yesu kamdasha, “Litawa lyaku ghani?”</para>
  <para style="p">Mweni kamyangula, “Litawa lyangu ‘Lipinga’ kwanongwa tutangala!” <verse number="10" style="v"/>Pambeli kayendelela kumluva Yesu akotoo kuvavinga finyamkela panji ya mumlima wula.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Kwaveli na lipinga likomi lya vangubi pabehi na chidunda vavelili vakulya. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Topi finyamkela vala vamluva Yesu pavadeta, “Tuyeghi kwa vangubi na utulekisheli tuvayingili.” <verse number="13" style="v"/>Yesu kavalekishela na finyamkela vala vamfuma mundu yula na kuyingila kwa vangubi. Lipinga lyosi lya vangubi elufu mbili vatuvilila mulihiva vamilwa machi vasova.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Vandu vavelili vakudima vangubi vala vatuva na kuvawombela vandu chilongu chila mumbwani na kufitava. Vandu vayenda kulola chila chigolikili, <verse number="15" style="v"/>pavafikili kwa Yesu, vamuwona mundu yula yavelili na lipinga lya finyamkela kayikala, kafwala yingwa shaki na luhala lwaki lumuwuyila, vosi vatila. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Vala vachiwonili chindu achi, vavawombela vandu vamonga chindu chimbwitukilili mundu yula yavelili na finyamkela na chilongu cha vangubi vala.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Topi, vandu vamluva Yesu awuki mumlima wawu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Yesu paghaveyi akwipaka muwatu, mundu yula yavelili na finyamkela kamluva vawuki pamu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Lakini Yesu kamukanila. Kamuwombela, “Yendi kaya kwa valongu vaku kavawombeli filongu fyosi Bambu fyakugolilili na ndambu yakuwonilili lusungu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Topi, mundu yula kuyenda kulandula milandu yosi ya Yesu yamgolilili aku Dekapoli. Na vandu vosi vapikanilili vajinga.</para>
  <para style="s">Muhinja wa Yailu na mdadala yagufyili yingwa ya Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">Mateyi 9:18-26, Lukasi 8:40-56</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Yesu kayipaka kandi muwatu kajabuka kumwambu ya lihiva. Lipinga likomi lya vandu lyamshengitelili muluwongu ya lihiva. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Mundu yumu yavelili mkomi wa nyumba ya kudadavila, litawa lyaki Yailu ayendili, pamuwonili Yesu, kamtundamila, <verse number="23" style="v"/>kamluva Yesu padeta, “Muhinja wangu akutamika dabadaba. Dekudeku wisi, umvikili mawoku vaku, ili anani.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>Topi, Yesu awukili pamu na Yailu. Vandu vamkovikela na kumkekeneka-kekeneka kwanongwa vatangalili ngenju.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>Paveli mdadala yumu yavelili na utami wa liholuveya myaka lilongu na mivili. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Mdadala ayu aifwashili nendu kwa vayilwana na amalili findu fyaki fitangalili, lakini kanana ha, ila kayendelela kutamika nendu chipindi chosi. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Papikanishili chilongu cha Yesu kwa vandu, kayisa na kayikekeneka kekeneka kupita mulipinga lya vandu. Kamyendela Yesu kwa kumbeli na kuyigufya yingwa yafwalili Yesu, <verse number="28" style="v"/>mweni ayidetilili, “Pagufya yingwa yaki hela, danani.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>Kagufya yingwa ya Yesu, bahala pala liholuveya limuwoloka na mweni kayiwona mumvili waki kucha utami unana. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Bahala pala Yesu kamanya liwovi limyangila. Topi, kalighalambukila lipinga lya vandu kadasha, “Ghani yagufyili yingwa yangu?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>Vanachuli vaki vamyangula, “Ukuwona ndambu vandu yavakukekeneka kekeneka na yuwi ukudasha, ‘Ghani ayu yakugufyili?’”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>Lakini Yesu kayendelela kulola amuwoni mundu yagolili chindu achi. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Mdadala yula kachimanya chindu chimbwitukilili, ndambu ayi kamyendela pabagama kwa lyogha. Kamuwila pamawulu vaki, pambeli kamuwombela fyosi nakaka. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Yesu kamuwombela, “Kamwali wangu, ujumilwa waku wukulowola. Yendi kwa kusika na wuvi mnofu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v"/>Yesu paghaveyi akudeta ndambu ayi, vayisa vandu kufuma kaya ya Yailu, yula mkomi wa nyumba ya kudadavila. Vamuwombela Yailu, “Muhinja waku kasova kala. Wuli ukumyasha muwula?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v"/>Lakini Yesu papikanishili chavadetili, kabedala, kamuwombela yula mkomi wa nyumba ya kudadavila, “Kotoo kutila, ujumili hela.” <verse number="37" style="v"/>Yesu kadayila ng'odu mundu yoyosi ayilongoshi na mweni, ila Petili, Yakobi na Yohani, mlongu waki Yakobi. <verse number="38" style="v"/>Pavafikili kaya kwa Yailu mkomi wa nyumba ya kudadavila, Yesu kawona ndilingu na papikanishili vandu vakulila na kudadava. <verse number="39" style="v"/>Yesu kayingila munyumba, kavawombela “Wuli mkugola ndilingu na kulila? Mwana kasova ng'odu, kawonja hela!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v"/>Lakini veni vamseka, topi, kavafumisha vosi panji. Kavatola tati na mau wa mwana yula, pamu na vanachuli vaki vatatu vavelili nawu, vayingila muchumbagati chivamuwonjishili mwana yula. <verse number="41" style="v"/>Yesu katola liwoku, kamuwombela, “Talita koumu!” Mana yaki, “Muhinja, ngukuwombela tandamuki!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v"/>Bahala pala muhinja yula kayimuka na kakanda kuyendayenda. Muhinja yula aveli na myaka lilongu limu na mivili. Pafibwitukili afi, vandu vajinga nendu. <verse number="43" style="v"/>Lakini Yesu kavakana nendu vakotoo kumuwombela mundu yoyosi chilongu achi chigolikili. Pambeli Yesu kavawombela “Mumgayili muhinja ayu filivi.”</para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu akukaniwa aku Nasaleti</para>
  <para style="r">Mateyi 13:53-58, Lukasi 4:16-30</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Yesu kawuka pala, kayenda mumbwani yaki, vandundami vaki vamkovikela. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Palifikili lijuva lya kupumulila, kakanda kuwula munyumba ya kudadavila. Vandu vatangalili vampikanishili vajinga, vadasha, “Kafipata koti fyosi afi? Luhunja liki alu kagayiliwa? Wuliwuli akuwesha kugola mihilu ayi? <verse number="3" style="v"/>Ayu msongola findu ng'odu? Mwana wa Maliya na valongu vaki vakina Yakobi, Yose, Yuda na Simoni? Na vahaja vaki vakwikala bahapa ng'odu?” Topi, vamlema.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>Yesu kavawombela, “Mbuyi akupikanishwa mahali posi, ila akupikanishwa ha mumbwani yaki na kwa valongu vaki na kaya yaki.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Yesu kawesha ha kugola mihilu yoyosi pala, kavavikila vatami vadokwa hela mawoku, kavalowola. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Kajinga nendu kwanongwa vandu vavahela ujumilwa.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akuvalayisha vanachuli lilongu na vavili</para>
  <para style="r">Mateyi 10:5-15, Lukasi 9:1-6</para>
  <para style="p">Pambeli Yesu kafityangila fijiji fya pabehi, pavawula vandu. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Kavakema vala vanachuli lilongu na vavili, kakanda kuvalayisha vavili vavili. Kavagayila uwesu wa kuvawusha finyamkela. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Pambeli kavawombela, “Mkotoo kutola chindu chochosi mumwanja, ila lukweku weka hela. Mkotoo kutola filivi, wala muhaku, wala mbiya muchiwunu. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Mfwali filatu, lakini mukotoo kutola yingwa yimonga. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Nyumba yoyosi yivavalibushila, mwikali mula mbaka pamuwuka mbwani ayi. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Na mahali poposi vandu pavalema kuvalibushila ama kuvapikanisha, muwuki mupundi lifu mumawulu venu. Ayi dayivi utovileli kwa veni.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Topi vayenda na kuvalandulila vandu vapomeli. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Vavafumisha finyamkela vatangalili na kuvashaya mafuta vatami vatangalili na kuvalowola.</para>
  <para style="s">Kusova kwa Yohani yabatisha</para>
  <para style="r">Mateyi 14:1-12, Lukasi 9:7-9</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Mutwa Helodi papikanishili filongu afi fyosi, kwanongwa litawa lya Yesu lipikanika mahali posi. Vandu vamonga vadetili, “Yohani mbatisha kashukuka! Ndi nongwa yaveli na liwovi lya kugola mihilu ayi.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Lakini vamonga vadetili, “Ayu Eliya.”</para>
  <para style="p">Vamonga vadetili, “Ayu mbuyi, kucha vala vambuyi va dahili.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Helodi papikanishili filongu afi, kadeta, “Yohani mbatisha yindimdumulili mutwi kashukuka!” <verse number="17" style="v"/>Kwa nongwa dahili Helodi mweni alayishili kucha Yohani mbatisha akamuliwi na awopiwi muchijaka. Agolili naha kwanongwa amuhetili Helodiya, mdala wa Filipu na Filipu avelili mfwata mundu Helodi <verse number="18" style="v"/>Yohani mbatisha amuwombilili Helodi, “Malawu vakulema yuwi kumtola mwehi wa mlongu waku!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Naha Helodiya kamkalalila nendu Yohani mbatisha, kadayila kumuwulagha, lakini kawesha ha nongwa ya Helodi. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Helodi amtilili Yohani mbatisha kwanongwa amanyili aveli mundu mnofu yang'alili, topi aveli akumlolela. Adayilaya kumpikanisha Yohani mbatisha, mani hela pamupikanishili kala, ajingili nendu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Lijuva limu Helodiya apatili fwasi mulihungu lya kuwoneka kwa Helodi. Helodi avagolilili lihungu vatavala, vakulu va machonda na filongosi wa mlima wa Galilaya. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Muhinja wa Helodiya payingilili kufina, afinili finofu, Helodi na vahenja vaki vasekilili. Topi mutwa kamuwombela muhinja yula, “Luvi chindu chochosi chiwudayila, nenga dangugayili.” <verse number="23" style="v"/>Kandi kayilapa, “Dangugayili chochosi chiwudayila, hata nusu ya wutwa wangu!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>Bahala pala muhinja yula kayenda kumudasha mau waki, “Nuvi liki?”</para>
  <para style="p">Na mweni kamyangula, “Luvi mutwi wa Yohani mbatisha.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>Bahala pala mhinja yula katuva kwa mutwa kumluva, “Ngudayila ugayili ponopa mutwi wa Yohani mbatisha muluselu!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>Mutwa kang'onguteka nendu, lakini kawesha ha kulema, kwanongwa ayilapili paulongolu ya vahenja vaki. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Bahala pala mutwa kamulayisha machonda akayeghi mutwi wa Yohani mbatisha. Machonda kayenda muchijaka kamdumula Yohani mutwi waki. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Pambeli kauyegha mutwi wula muluselu kamgayila muhinja, mweni kamgayila mau waki. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Vanachuli va Yohani mbatisha pavapikanishili afi, vayenda kuutola mvili waki na kuusika.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akuvagayila filivi vandu elufu muhanu</para>
  <para style="r">Mateyi 14:13-21, Lukasi 9:10-17, Yohani 6:1-14</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v"/>Vandundami vawuyili vatangana kwa Yesu, vamuwombela fyosi fila fyavagolili na kuwula. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Yesu kavawombela, “Tuyendi weka yetu mahali pangajila vandu, mkapumulili padokwa.” Adetili ndambu ayi kwanongwa kwavelili na vandu vatangalili vavelili vakwisa na kuwuka, mbaka vapata ha fwasi ya kulya filivi. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Topi vawuka weka yawu muwatu, vayenda mahali pangajila mundu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v"/>Lakini vandu vavawonili pavaveghi vakuwuka, vavamanyili. Topi, vatuva kwa mawulu kufuma mbwani shosi na vatalili kufika. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Yesu pafumili muwatu, aliwonili lipinga likomi lya vandu. Kavawonela lusungu kwanongwa vaveli kucha vameni vangajila mdima. Topi kakanda kuvawula findu fitangalili.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v"/>Lumihi palufikili, vanachuli va Yesu vamyendela na kumuwombela, “Mahali apa pangajila vandu na lijuva lihonga. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Uvaleki vandu vayendi kufitava na mufijiji fya pabehi vakayihemeleli filivi.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v"/>Lakini Yesu kavayangula, “Yumwi muvapi filivi valyi.”</para>
  <para style="p">Vamdasha, “Ponopa tuyendi tukahemeli mibumunda ya mbiya sha ijala ya myesi minani.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v"/>Kavadasha, “Muva na mibumunda miningi? Muyendi mkaloli.”</para>
  <para style="p">Pavalolili kala, vamuwombela, “Tuva na mibumunda muhanu na vasomba vavili hela.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v"/>Pambeli Yesu kavawombela vanachuli vaki vavawombeli vandu vosi vayitapuli mufipinga-fipinga, vayikali pasi mulugobi. <verse number="40" style="v"/>Topi, vandu vayikala mufipinga fya vandu miya yimu fya vandu milongu muhanu. <verse number="41" style="v"/>Pambeli Yesu kaitola mibumunda yila muhanu na vasomba vavili. Kalola kumbindi, kamlumba Chapanga na kuyimetula yila mibumunda. Pambeli kavapa vanachuli vaki vavapi vandu. Wuwula wula kavapa vandu vosi vala vasomba vavili. <verse number="42" style="v"/>Vandu vosi valya vayikuta. <verse number="43" style="v"/>Vanachuli va Yesu vasola mibumunda na vasomba vasighalili vamemesha fitandavala lilongu limu na fivili. <verse number="44" style="v"/>Vandu vosi valili valulumi vaveli alufu muhanu.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akuyendayenda kumbindi ya machi</para>
  <para style="r">Mateyi 14:22-33, Yohani 6:15-21</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v"/>Bahala pala Yesu kavawombela vanachuli vaki vayingili muwatu, vamlonguleli kuyenda Betisayida. Mweni aveli akuvatawula vandu. <verse number="46" style="v"/>Pamalili kuvayitawula vandu, kayenda kuchidunda kumdadava Chapanga. <verse number="47" style="v"/>Lumihi palufikili, watu waveli pagati ya lihiva, mweni aveli weka hela kumwambu ya lihiva. <verse number="48" style="v"/>Kavawona vanachuli vaki vakukimbanika kuguba watu kwa ngafi, kwanongwa liyegha lyaveli likuvalimba. Payiveyi samba kulangala, Yesu kavayendela payendayenda kumbindi ya machi. Akadayileyi kuvapita, <verse number="49" style="v"/>kumbi veni pavamuwonili akuyendayenda kumbindi ya machi, vadeta aveli chishuka. Vawuta, <verse number="50" style="v"/>kwanongwa vosi pavamuwonili vatilili nendu.</para>
  <para style="p">Bahala pala Yesu kavawombela, “Ndiva nenga! Mkotoo kutila, mugangamali.” <verse number="51" style="v"/>Pambeli kayingila muwatu pamu nawu na uyegha unyamala. Vanachuli vaki vajinga nendu, <verse number="52" style="v"/>kwanongwa vaveli vakali hela kumanya mana ya kuvagayila mibumunda yila valyi, ndima shawu shaveli sidindala.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akuvalowola vatami aku Genesaleti.</para>
  <para style="r">Mateyi 14:34-36</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v"/>Vajabuka lihiva, vayisa mumlima wa Genesaleti, pala vapayika watu wawu. <verse number="54" style="v"/>Pavajabukili muwatu, bahala pala vandu vamumanya Yesu. <verse number="55" style="v"/>Topi, vatuva mumlima wosi na vavatola vatami muluhagha na kuvayegha mahali poposi pavapikanishili Yesu paghaveyi. <verse number="56" style="v"/>Mahali poposi Yesu payendili, kufijiji, mumbwani, awu kufitava, vandu vavavika vatami pawelu. Vamluva avaleki vagufyi lupembu lwa yingwa yaki na vosi vagufyili vanana.</para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Mawuli ya vavaha</para>
  <para style="r">Mateyi 15:1-9</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Vafwalisayu vamu na vawula va Malawu vafumili Yelusalemu vamushengitelili Yesu. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Vavawona vanachuli vamu va Yesu vakulya filivi kwa mawoku mawafu, nyanyi vanava ha kucha chishovi chawu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>Kwa nongwa Vafwalisayu na Vayawudi vosi vakulya ha filivi mbaka vanavi mawoku vawu kucha wuvakamulili chishovi cha vavaha vawu. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Pavafuma kusoku vakulya ha chindu chochosi mbaka vachiwofuwi. Wuwula wula vakamulili fishovi fimonga, kucha kuwofuwa fikombi, fiyungu, fihela na fyombu fya chumang'andu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Topi, Vafwalisayu vala na vawula va Malawu vamdasha Yesu, “Kwa nongwa liki vanachuli vaku vakukamula ha fishovi fya vavaha, ila veni vakulya kwa mawoku ‘Va wafu?’”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Yesu kavayangula, “Isaya atungili unofu, yumwi vafyangu, kucha fyayandikili:</para>
  <para style="q">‘Vandu ava vakujuma kwa milomu yawu,</para>
  <para style="q">lakini ndima shawu siva kutali na nenga.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Vakundundamila hela, pavawula fishovi fya vandu, kucha malayishu va Chapanga!’</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>“Yumwi mukuvaleka Malawu va Chapanga na kukamula fishovi fya vandu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Yesu ayendililili kudeta, “Mukuyihola mugola finofu, lakini muvalema Malawu va Chapanga ili mkamuli fishovi fyenu. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Kwa nongwa Musa adetili, ‘Vapikani tati waku na mawaku, mundu yoyosi yamjowola tati mundu awu mamundu dawulayiwi.’ <verse number="11" style="v"/>Lakini yumwi mukudeta, kucha mundu yaveli na chindu cha kumtanga tati mundu awu mamundu, lakini kadeta chindu achi ‘Kolibani’ mana yaki, fupu kwa Chapanga, <verse number="12" style="v"/>topi mukudeta, mundu ayu akulemiwa kumtanga tati mundu awu mamundu. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Topi, mkuchibedala chilongu cha Chapanga kwanongwa ya fishovi fyenu fyimukamulili. Kandi mukugola findu fitangalili fya ndambu ayi.”</para>
  <para style="s">Findu fimugola mundu ghavi mwafu</para>
  <para style="r">Mateyi 15:10-20</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Yesu kalikema kandi lipinga lila lya vandu. Kavawombela, “Mpikanishi vosi mumanya. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Kwahela chindu chimuyingila mundu chiwesha kumgola ghavi mwafu. Ila fila fimfuma mundu, fyeni fikumugola ghavi mwafu. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Mundu yaveli na majeji va kupikanishila, apikani” <note caller="g" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:16 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Mundu yaveli na majeji apikani. Mayandiku vamonga va dahili vavahela msitali wa 16.</char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Palilekili lipinga lya vandu na kuyingila munyumba, vanachuli vaki vamdasha mana ya filangushilu afi. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Yesu kavawombela, “Hata yumwi muvahela luhala? Topi hata yumwi mumanya ng'odu kucha kwahela chindu chimuyingila mundu kufuma panji chimgola mundu ghavi ‘Mwafu’? <verse number="19" style="v"/>Kwa nongwa chikumuyingila ha mundima, ila chikuyingila munda, pambeli chikufuma panji ya mvili waki.” Kwa kudeta naha, Yesu kafigola filivi fyosi finofu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Kayendelela kudeta, “Chindu chimfuma mundu ndi chimgola ghavi mwafu. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Kwa nongwa mundima ya mundu kukufuma hoshu wafu na uwoni na wifi na kuwulagha na fimonga upeji na <verse number="22" style="v"/>uwoni ubafu na wafu na ufyangu na lumatamata pamu na weyi na majowolu na lukilu na upufi. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Fyosi afi fikufuma mugati ya mundu, ndi fikumugola mundu ghavi mwafu.”</para>
  <para style="s">Ujumilwa wa mdadala yumu</para>
  <para style="r">Mateyi 15:21-28</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>Pambeli Yesu kawuka mahali pala, kayenda mumbwani ya Tilu. Aku kayingila munyumba yimu na kadayila ha mundu yoyosi amanyi. Lakini kawesha ha kuyififa. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Mdadala yumu yavelili na muhinja yaveli na chinyamkela, apikanishili filongu fya Yesu. Topi, bahala pala kamuyendela na kumuwila mumawulu vaki. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Mdadala ayu aveli mugiliki na awonikili mumbwani ya Silofoiniki. Kamluva Yesu amuwushi chinyamkela muhinja waki. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Lakini Yesu kamuwombela, “Leki tani vana vayikuti. Nyanyi ha kutola filivi fya vana na kuvagayila vagalu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>Mdadala yula kamuyangula, “Yina Bambu, lakini hata vagalu yivavelili pasi ya mesa vakulya mipwambwa ya filivi fya vana!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>Yesu kamuwombela, “Kwa ndambu yiwuyangulili, yendi kaya dawuwoni chinyamkela kamfuma muhinja waku!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v"/>Mdadala yula kayenda kaya yaki, kamuwona mwana waki kawonja paulili na chinyamkela kamfuma kala.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akumlowola mundu majogu na ngadeta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>Pambeli Yesu kawuka mumbwani ya Tilu, kayenda mbaka Sidoni afikili lihiva lya Galilaya, kupitila Dekapoli. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Vandu vamu vamuyeghela mundu yavelili majogu na yangajila kudeta unofu. Vamluva Yesu amvikili mawoku. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Yesu kamukwegha pambali na vandu. Kavika fyala fyaki mumajeji va mundu ayu. Pambeli atemili mita na kugufya lulimi lwa mundu yula. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Pambeli Yesu kalola kumbindi, kapumula nendu na kumuwombela mundu ayu, “Efwata” Mana yaki “Fuwuki!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v"/>Bahala pala majeji va mundu yula vadiwuka, lulimi lwaki lufuwuka, kakanda kudeta unofu. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Yesu kavakanila kumuwombela mundu yoyosi. Lakini ndambu payendelelili kuvakanila, ndi ndambu yayendililili kukwisha filongu fyaki. <verse number="37" style="v"/>Vandu vajinga nendu. Vadeta, “Kagola fyosi finofu. Kavagola majogu vapikana na vangadeta vadeti!”</para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu akuvapa filivi vandu nendu ya elufu mchechi</para>
  <para style="r">Mateyi 15:32-39</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Chipindi achi, lipinga lingi likomi lya vandu vayikungula, vaveli vahela filivi. Topi Yesu avakemili vanachuli vaki, avawombilili, <verse number="2" style="v"/>“Nguvawonela lusungu vandu ava nongwa tuyikala pamu kwa majuva matatu nalelu vavahela filivi. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Panivaleka vayendi kaya na njala davashungi mudeha, nongwa vamonga vafuma kutali.” <verse number="4" style="v"/>Vanachuli vaki vamudasha, “Kunu kudasi datupati koti mibumunda ya kuyikuta vandu vosi ava?” <verse number="5" style="v"/>Yesu avadashili, “Muna mibumunda miningi?” Vamyangula, “Tuva na mibumunda saba.” <verse number="6" style="v"/>Topi kavalayila vayikali pasi, kayitola yila mibumunda saba, kamdadava Chapanga, kayimetula mibumunda, kavagayila vanachuli vaki, veni vavagayili vandu. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Vavelili kandi na fisomba fidokwa. Yesu kafinemela, wuwula kavagayila, vavagayili vandu. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Vandu valya, vayikuta. Vayola fisiyalili vamemesha fitandavala saba. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Vandu valili vaveli vatangalili nendu ya elufu mchechi vavalangiwili. Pambeli Yesu avatawulili, <verse number="10" style="v"/>tepu vayipakili muwatu pamu na vanachuli vaki, vayenda boma lya Dalimanuta.</para>
  <para style="s">Vafwalisayu vadayila kuwona mihilu</para>
  <para style="r">Mateyi 12:38-42, 16:1-4</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Vafwalisayu vakalimbaneyi, vakanda kumuwomesha Yesu. Vakadayileyi agoli chilangushilu kufuma kwa Chapanga. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Yesu akawoneyi lusungu mundima, kawomba, “Mbona chileli cha ponopa chikudayila mihilu? Nakaka nguvawombela, chileli cha chipindi achi dachipati ha chilangushilu chochosi.” <verse number="13" style="v"/>Topi kavaleka, kayipakila kandi muwatu, akandili mwanja kuyenda kumwambu.</para>
  <para style="s">Simika ya Vafwalisayu na ya Helodi</para>
  <para style="r">Mateyi 16:5-12</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Vanachuli vayivasuwili kutola mibumunda, wumu hela vasiyalili nawu mula muwatu. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Yesu kavalayila, “Muvi mesu! Mulyepi na simika ya Vafwalisayu na simika ya Helodi.” <verse number="16" style="v"/>Vanachuli vakanda kuwombana veni, “Kadeta naha kwanongwa twahela mibumunda.” <verse number="17" style="v"/>Yesu amanyili kala, avawombilili, “Mbona mkuwombana mwahela mibumunda? Wuli mkalihela kumanya? Wuli ndima shenu sikali hela kumanya? <verse number="18" style="v"/>Wuli muva na mesu mkulola ha? Muva na majeji na mukupikanila ha Muva hela ngumbungumbu? <verse number="19" style="v"/>Chipindi chila pametuleyi yila mibumunda muhanu na kuvagayila vandu nendu ya elufu muhanu? Vakunga fitandavala finingi fya filivi fisighalili?” Vamuyangula, “Fyaveli lilongu na fivili.” <verse number="20" style="v"/>“Pametuleyi yila mibumunda saba na kuvagayila vandu nendu ya elufu mchechi mkunga filivi fisiyalili finingi?”</para>
  <para style="p">Vayangula, “Fyaveli saba.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Topi kavadasha, “Mkali hela kumanya?”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akumlowola ngalimesu aku Betisayida</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Yesu kafika Betisayida pamu na vanachuli vaki. Kuna vandu vamuyeghilili mundu ngalimesu, vamluvili amugufyi. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Yesu amkamulili liwoku yula ngalimesu, kamyegha panji ya kaya yila. Amutemilili mita mumesu, kamvikila mawoku, kamdasha, “Wuli ukuwesha kulola chindu?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>Ayu ngalimesu kalola, kadeta, “Nguwona vandu vakuyendayenda vakuwoneka kucha mibiki.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>Yesu amuvikilili kandi mawoku mumesu mweni kafulutula mesu, uwesu wa kulola umuwuyila, kila chindu kachiwona uswanu. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Yesu kamuwombela ayendi kaya na kumulayila, “Akotoo kuwuya muchijiji chila!”</para>
  <para style="s">Petili akujumila Yesu ndi Kilistu mkombola.</para>
  <para style="r">Mateyi 16:13-20, Lukasi 9:18-21</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>Pambeli Yesu na vanachuli vaki vayendili kufijiji fya pabehi ya Kayisalia Filipu. Pavaveghi munjila, Yesu kavadasha vanachuli, “Vandu vakudeta nenga ghani?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>Vamuyangula, “Vakudeta yuwi Eliya, vamonga Yohani mbatisha na vamonga yumu wa vambuyi.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>Pambeli Yesu kavadasha, “Yumwi mukucha nenga ghani?”</para>
  <para style="p">Petili kamyangula, “Yuwi Kilistu.” <note caller="h" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:29 </char><char style="fk">Kilistu:</char> Kwa Chigiliki Kilistu nongwa yaki Mkombola ashawuliwili na Chapanga kuva Mutwa. Kwa Chibulaniya litawa ali Masiya </note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v"/>Yesu avakanili vakotoo kumuwombela mundu yoyosi filongu afi.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akudeta ndambu dagobuliwi, dasovi na ndambu dashukuki.</para>
  <para style="r">Mateyi 16:21-28, Lukasi 9:22-27</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>Yesu akandili kuwula vanachuli vaki Mwana wa Mundu dagobuliwi nendu na dalemwi na vavaha na vatambika vakomi, na vawula va Malawu. Kadeta davamuwulayi, mulijuva lya tatu kukandila pasovili dashukuki. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Yesu kavawombela, filongu afi ngatu hela. Petili amkweyili pambali, akandili kumlakalila. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Yesu kavaghalambukila vanachuli vaki, kamlakalila Petili padeta, “Wuki paulongolu yangu Lijangavandu! Ukuyihola fya mundu, fya Chapanga ha.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v"/>Pambeli kalikema lipinga lya vandu pamu na vanachuli vaki, avawombilili, “Kucha mundu yoyosi yadayila ghavi ndumindumi wa nenga, ayilemi mweni, atoli lupingika lwaki, angovikeli. <verse number="35" style="v"/>Mundu yadayila kulowosha unofu waki mweni, davayamishi, lakini mundu dayasi unofu waki kunata nenga kwa Chilongu cha Nyanyi, dalowuliwi. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Mundu dapati liki mani mlima wosi pawuva waki na kuyamisha ndima yaki? <verse number="37" style="v"/>Mundu datoli chindu liki badili ya ndima yaki. <verse number="38" style="v"/>Mundu yoyosi muchileli achi cha sambi na chingali kumpikanisha Chapanga na yang'onela soni nenga na mawuli vangu, Mwana wa Mundu damuwoneli soni mundu ayu, chipindi padayila kuyisa kuukomi wa Tati waki pamu na makungu vang'alili.”</para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Yesu kavawombela, “Nakaka nguvawombela, kuna vamonga bahapa davasovi ng'odu mbaka vauwoni Wutwa wa kumbindi kwa Chapanga pauyisa kwa liwovi.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu aghalambukili mvili</para>
  <para style="r">Mateyi 17:1-13, Lukasi 9:28-36</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v"/>Pavapitili majuva sita, Yesu kavatola Petili, Yakobi na Yohani kumbindi ya chidunda chitali weka yawu. Kula Yesu aghalambukili mvili paulongolu yawu, <verse number="3" style="v"/>yingwa shaki shang'alili mbuletee, shaveli ngeli nendu, kwa hela mundu yafuva yingwa yoyosi mumlima ndambu yila. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Pambeli Eliya na Musa vafumbuka, vakaywangeyi na Yesu. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Petili kamuwombela Yesu, “Muwula, nyanyi yufwi tuyikali bahapa. Ngiba tujengi mibudi mitatu, limu lya yuwi limu lya Musa na limu lya Eliya.” <verse number="6" style="v"/>Petili na vayaki vatila, amanyili ha chindu cha kuwomba.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Pambeli lifumbuka lifundi livagubika na lishu lipikanika kufuma mulifundi, “Ayu mwana wangu yinimtamili, yanoviliwili nenga mumpikanishi mweni.” <verse number="8" style="v"/>Tepu vanachuli vala valola lola, hata naha vawona ng'odu mundu wingi, ila veni pamu na Yesu weka yaki.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Pavasunukeyi kuchidunda, Yesu avakanili, “Mukotoo kumuwombela mundu yoyosi findu fimufiwonili, mbaka Mwana wa Mundu pashukuka kufuma kwa vasovili.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Topi vajumila ndambu avalayili, lakini vakalimbaneyi veni kwa veni mana ya kushukuka kufuma kwa vasovili. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Vamdasha Yesu, “Kwa nongwa liki vawula va Malawu vakadeteyi lasima ayisi tanila Eliya?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Mweni kavayangula, “Yina Eliya akwisa tanila kugolikesha findu fyosi fya kukandila. Lakini nongwa liki yivayandikilili Mumayandiku vang'alili vakudeta Mwana wa Mundu dagobolewi nendu na kubedaliwa? <verse number="13" style="v"/>Lakini nguvawombela, Eliya kayisa kala, veni vamgolela vadayilili veni kucha fyavamyandikilili mumayandiku.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akumlowola msongolu aveli na chinyamkela</para>
  <para style="r">Mateyi 17:14-21, Lukasi 9:37-43</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Pavawuyili vala vanachuli vamonga, vawona lipinga likomi lya vandu pala. Vawula va Malawu vaveli vakuwombana nawu. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Tepu lipinga lya vandu pavamuwonili, wosi vayikanganika nendu, vamtuvilila kumjambusha. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Yesu kavadasha vanachuli, “Mkuhimula liki na ava?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Apa mundu yumu mulipinga lila lya vandu kamyangula, “Muwula, ndimuyegha mwana wangu kwa yuwi, kana chinyamkela akumgola akotoo kudeta. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Kila pamyisila, akumuwisha pasi akumgola afumi mifulufulu mumlomu, akugwelujula minu na kuyuma mvili wosi, vanachuli vaku navaluvili vamuwushi chinyamkela yula valemwa.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Yesu kavawombela, “Yumwi valelwa va ponopa mungajila kujumila nenga! Dandiyikali na yumwi mbaka ndili? Daniyiwunishili kwa yumwi mbaka ndili? Munyegheli msongolu ayu!” <verse number="20" style="v"/>Vamyegha kwa Yesu.</para>
  <para style="p">Yula chinyamkela pamuwonili Yesu, bahala pala amtayili chipwembu, kamuwisha pasi, kaghalafuka na kufuma mifulufulu mumlomu. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Yesu kamdasha tati mundu mwana yula, “Kava naha kufumila ndili?”</para>
  <para style="p">Mweni kayangula, “Kufumila akali chali. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Myanja yitangalili chinyamkela akadayileyi kumuwulagha amuwishili mumotu na mumachi. Mani ukuwesha, topi utuwoneli lusungu na ututangi!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Yesu kamuwombela, “Kwa liki ukudeta kucha pauwesha? Findu fyosi fikuweshikana, mundu pajumila nenga.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>Bahala pala tati yula kalandula, “Ngukujumila, topi undangi ngujumili nendu!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>Yesu pawonili lipinga lya vandu likulopukesha kuyongisheka paulongolu paki, kamlakalila yula chinyamkela, “Yuwi chinyamkela yiwumgolili msongola ayu ghavi ngadeta na majogu! Ngukuwombela, ufumi kwa msongolu ayu, peli kumyingila kandi!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>Pala yula chinyamkela kawuta kwa lishu likomi, kamuwisha pasi, pambeli kamfuma. Msongolu kawoneka kucha chikongu, topi vamonga vakawombeyi, “kasova!” <verse number="27" style="v"/>Lakini Yesu kamkamula liwoku, kamuwolosha na mweni kawoloka.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>Topi Yesu payingilili munyumba, vanachuli vaki vamdasha kwa lufisu, “Kwa nongwa liki yufwi tulemwa kumfumisha chinyamkela?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>Yesu kavawombela, “Chinyamkela wa ndambu ayi afumi ha mbaka kumdadavila Chapanga hela.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akudeta chilongu cha kusova kwa mweni</para>
  <para style="r">Mateyi 17:22-23, Lukasi 9:43-45</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v"/>Yesu na vanachuli vaki vawuka pala, vayendilela na mwanja kupitila mlima wa Galilaya. Yesu adayilili ha vandu vamanyi kakoti, <verse number="31" style="v"/>Kwanongwa avelili akuvawula vanachuli vaki. Kavawombela, “Mwana wa mundu davamhadiki kwa vandu vala davamuwulayi, hata naha pavapita majuva matatu kufuma pavamuwulayili dashukuki.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>Vanachuli vaki vamanya ng'odu fyadetili, topi vatila kumdasha.</para>
  <para style="s">Ghani mkomi?</para>
  <para style="r">Mateyi 18:1-5, Lukasi 9:46-48</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v"/>Topi pavafikili Kapelinaumu. Pavaveghi munyumba Yesu avadashili vanachuli vaki, “Mkawombaneyi liki munjila?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v"/>Veni vanyamala, nongwa munjila vavelili vakulimbana ghani mkomi. <verse number="35" style="v"/>Yesu kayikala pasi, kavakema vala lilongu na vavili, kavawombela, “Mundu padayila kuva wa kwaa ghavi wa kumbeli na ndumindumi va wosi.” <verse number="36" style="v"/>Pambeli kamtola mwana mdokwa, kamwolosha pagati yawu, kamkusikila, kavawombela. <verse number="37" style="v"/>“Mundu yoyosi yamupokela mwana kucha ayu kwa litawa lyangu, akumbokela nenga. Na mundu yoyosi yambokela nenga, akumbokela weka yangu ha, akumpokela na yula yanayishili.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yangajila kutulimba kava na yufwi</para>
  <para style="r">Lukasi 9:49-50</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v"/>Yohani kamwombela, “Muwula, tumuwona mundu yumu pawusha finyamkela kwa litawa lyaku, yufwi kumkanisha kwanongwa mweni muyetu ha.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v"/>Lakini Yesu kadeta, “Mkotoo kumkanisha, nongwa kwa hela mundu yagola mihilu kwa litawa lyangu na chipindi chichila kudeta filongu fya wafu kwa nenga. <verse number="40" style="v"/>Nongwa, yangajila kulimbana na yufwi, kava na yufwi. <verse number="41" style="v"/>Mundu yoyosi davapi machi va kulanda kamamya yumwi muva vandu va Kilistu nakaka dayimpoti ha kupokela fupu shaki.”</para>
  <para style="s">Ngwalu sha sambi</para>
  <para style="r">Mateyi 18:6-9, Lukasi 17:1-2</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v"/>“Yoyosi yadayila kumpughanya yumu wa ava vadokwa vajumilili nenga, Yingavelili ngiba mundu ayu awopiliwi ligonguweli likomi mungulu yaki na kumdubushila mulweni. <verse number="43" style="v"/>Kucha liwoku lyaku palikuvifya, lidumuli. Ngiba uyingili muunofu wa jola na liwoku limu, pitu kuyingila kulifumbika na mawoku mavili. Aku motu waki ukujimika ng'odu.” <verse number="44" style="v"/>Aku, vang'ongolu vakuvalya davasovi ha jola na motu ukuvanyanya ungajila kujima. Mayandiku vamonga va dahili vavahela msitali 44. <verse number="45" style="v"/>Na liwulu lyaku palikuvifya, lidumuli. Ngiba uyingili muunofu wa jola na liwulu limu, pitu kuva na mawulu vosi mavili na kudangiwa kulifumbika. <verse number="46" style="v"/>Aku vang'ongolu vakuvalya davasovi ha jola na motu ukuvanyanya ungajila kujima. <note caller="j" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:46 </char><char style="fk">Aku vang'ongolu vakuvalya davasovi ha jola na motu ungajila kujima ng'odu:</char> Mayandiku vamonga va dahili vahela msitali 46:’</note> <verse number="47" style="v"/>Na lisu lyaku palikugola uvifyi, likolopoli! Ngiba uyingili kuwutwa wa Chapanga na lisu limu hela, pitu kuva na mesu vosi mavili na kudangiwa mulifumbika. <verse number="48" style="v"/>Mula vang'ongolu vaki davalumi na vakusova ng'odu na motu waki wa lifumbika. <verse number="49" style="v"/>“Kila mundu dasingiwi kwa motu kucha wula nyama payilungiwa munyu yikotoo kuwola.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v"/>“Munyu wa nyanyi, mani pavayaghamisha kubaka kwaki, dauwuyishiwi na liki ili ubaki?</para>
  <para style="p">“Muvi na lighanja mugati yenu, muyikali kwa kusika yumwi kwa yumwi.”</para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Chilongu cha kuyiheta na kulekana</para>
  <para style="r">Mateyi 19:1-12, Lukasi 16:18</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Yesu afumili apa kayenda mlima wa Yudeya, mbaka kumwambu ya lweni lwa Yoludani. Lipinga lya vandu limyendela kandi, mweni kavawula kandi kucha yivelili chishovi chaki.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v"/>Topi Vafwalisayu vamyendela, vakamyeshi vamdasha, “Wuli nyanyi Malawu va yufwi, mlumi kumleka mdala waki?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>Yesu kavadasha, “Musa kavalayila liki?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>Veni vayangula, “Musa katulayila mlumi pamuleka mdala waki kwa kumgayila talaka.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Yesu kavawombela, “Musa avayandikilili Malawu kwanongwa ya ndima shyenu sidindalili. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Kufuma ulumbi wa mlima, Chapanga kalumba mlumi na mdala. Mayandiku vakuwomba, <verse number="7" style="v"/>‘Mlumi damleki tati waki na mau waki, kuyenda kuyilumba na mdala waki, <verse number="8" style="v"/>davavi mvili wumu.’ Ponopa vava kucha mvili wumu, vavili kandi ha. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Topi chalumbili Chapanga, mundu alekanishi ng'odu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Pavayingilili kandi munyumba, vanachuli vaki vamdashili filongu fila. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Mweni kavawombela, “Yamleka mdala mundu wa kwaa na kumheta wingi akali akagola uwoni. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Na mdala yamleka mlumi waki wa kwaa na kutoliwa na wingi akugola uwoni.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akuvavikila mawoku vananguta</para>
  <para style="r">Mateyi 19:13-15, Lukasi 18:15-17</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Vandu vamuyeghela Yesu vananguta avavikili mawoku, lakini vanachuli vaki vavalakalila. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Yesu pawonili nawula, akalalili kavawombela, “Muvaleki vananguta ava vayisi kwa nenga, mukotoo kavakanila, nongwa wutwa wa kumbindi kwa Chapanga wuva kwa vandu kucha vananguta ava. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Nguvawombela nakaka, mundu yoyosi yangajila kuupokela wutwa wa kumbindi kwa Chapanga kucha mwananguta, dayingili ng'o muwutwa wa kumbindi kwa Chapanga.” <verse number="16" style="v"/>Pambeli kavapokela vananguta vala kavakusikila na kuvanemela.</para>
  <para style="s">Mundu mlundamali</para>
  <para style="r">Mateyi 19:16-30, Lukasi 18:18-30</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Yesu pakandili kandi mwanja waki, mundu yumu kamtuvilila, kamtundamila paulongolu paki, kamdasha “Muwula msangi, goli wuliwuli mbati unofu wa jola?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Yesu kayangula, “Wuli ukungema msangi? Kwahela yaveli msangi ila Chapanga weka yaki. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Kuvamanya Malawu: ‘Ukotoo kugola uwoni, ukotoo kuwulagha, ukotoo kuhija, ukotoo kutovelela udesi, ukotoo kudeta ufyangu, uvatundamili tati waku na mau waku.’ ”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Mundu yula kamyangula, “Muwula, afi fyosi gola kukandila ngali msongolu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Yesu kamlola, kamtama, kamuwombela, “Chikupota chindu chimu, yendi kawuli findu fyosi fiwuveli nafyu, na mbiya dawusipati wuvagayili vagaju na yuwi dawuvi na lusanja kumbindi kwa Chapanga. Pambeli wisi ungovikeli.” <verse number="22" style="v"/>Papikanishili afi, ang'ong'utekili, ayendili kunu kakikinala, nongwa aveli na mali sitangalili.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Yesu alolili mbembi shosi, avawombilili vanachuli vaki, “Ndambu dayivi yidindala kwa valundamali kuyingila muwutwa wa kumbindi kwa Chapanga!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>Vanachuli vayikanganika filongu fyaki. Yesu kavawombela kandi, “Vana vangu, yidindala nendu kuyingila muwutwa wa kumbindi kwa Chapanga! <verse number="25" style="v"/>Yipusuka nendu kwa ng'ongolu mkomi kucha ndembu yivamkema ngamiya kwingila chilanga cha sasiya, ngatu hela mlundamali kuyingila muwutwa wa kumbindi kwa Chapanga!” <figure style="fig" desc="" file="14 Camel.jpg" size="col" loc="" copy="" ref="10:25">Ng'ongolu yivamkema ngamiya</figure></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>Vanachuli vaki vayikanganika nendu vakayidasheyi, “Ghani dawesi kulowoka?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>Yesu kavalola kavawombela, “Kwa mundu ahotoli ngo'du, lakini kwa Chapanga findu fyosi fikuhotuliwa.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>Petili kamuwombela, “Wuli yufwi tufileka findu fyosi, tukukovikela yuwi!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>Yesu adetili, “Nakaka nguvawombela, kila mundu yaleka libudi na mlongu na mhaja na mau na tati na vana na fitava kwanongwa ya nenga na kwanongwa ya Chilongu cha Nyanyi, <verse number="30" style="v"/>dapokeli fitangalili mumajuva ava. Dapokeli mibudi na valongu vahaja na vamau na vana pamu na kugoboka, mumajuva vakwisa dapokeli unofu wa jola. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Hata naha vatangalili vaveli vakomi mumlima davavi vadokwa na Vagaju vaveli mumlima davavi vakomi.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akudeta katatu dasovi na dashukuki</para>
  <para style="r">Mateyi 20:17-19, Lukasi 18:31-34</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>Topi pavaveghi munjila kuyenda kumbindi Yelusalemu na Yesu avalongulili. Vandumindumi vaki valwangili na vandu vamkovikeleyi vatilili. Yesu avatolili kandi pambali vala lilongu na vavili, kakanda kuvawombela fila dafimfiki. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Kavawombela, “Mpikanishi! Tukuyenda Yelusalemu, aku Mwana wa Mundu davamtoli kwa vatambika vakomi na vawula va Malawu. Veni davamuhighi njifwa, pambeli davamtoli kwa vandu vangajila kuva Vayawudi. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Veni davadanili na davandemeli mita, davandovi ndomondu na kung'ulaya. pavapita majuva matatu dashukuki.”</para>
  <para style="s">Chaluvili Yakobi na Yohani</para>
  <para style="r">Mateyi 20:20-28</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v"/>Yakobi na Yohani, vana va Sebidayu, vayendili kwa Yesu vamuwombela, “Muwula, tukudayila utugoleli chindu datukuluvi.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v"/>Yesu amdashili, “Mkudayila nivagoleli liki?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v"/>Vamyangula, “Utujumishi tuyikali yumu mwambu waku wa kumkiyi na yumonga kumlilu muukomi waki.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v"/>Yesu kavawombela, “Mumanya ng'odu mkudadava liki! Mkuwesha wuli wuli kulandila mulwindi lwa kugoboka, awu kabatishiwa kucha vabatishiwi nenga?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v"/>Vamyangula, “Tukuwesha.”</para>
  <para style="p">Yesu avawombilili, “Lwindi danandili damlandili nakaka na dambatishiwi kucha ndavabatishili. <verse number="40" style="v"/>Hata naha ghani dayikali mwambu wangu wa kumlilu awu kumkiyi, chichuku cha nenga ha kushaula ila davavi vala vavikiliwi kala.” <verse number="41" style="v"/>Vala vanachuli vamonga lilongu pavapikanishili afi, vakandili kuvakalalila Yakobi na Yohani. <verse number="42" style="v"/>Yesu avakemili, avawombilili, “Mumanya kucha vala vakwiholiwa vatavala va vandu, vakutavala vandu vawu kwa liwovi na vakomi ava vavatavalili vandu vawu. <verse number="43" style="v"/>Lakini kwa yumwi yikotoo kuva naha, ila yadayila kuva mkomi wenu, ghavi ndumindumi va yumwi. <verse number="44" style="v"/>Kwa yumwi yadayila kuva wa kwaa, ghavi ndumindumi va vosi. <verse number="45" style="v"/>Nongwa Mwana wa Mundu ayisili vakotoo kumkimbanikila ila kuvakimbanikila na kuvakombola vandu vatangalili.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akumlowola ngalimesu Balitimayu</para>
  <para style="r">Mateyi 20:29-34, Lukasi 18:35-43</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v"/>Topi vafikili Yeliku, Yesu paghaveyi akufuma pala na vanachuli vaki pamu na lipinga likomi lya vandu, ngalimesu, mwana va Timayu vakumkema Balitimayu, avelili kayikala mumbali ya deha akudadava vamutangi. <verse number="47" style="v"/>Papikanishili Yesu wa Nasaleti akutyangila pala, kakanda kukema kwa lishu likomi, “Yesu, Mwana va Dawudi! Ung'oneli lusungu!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v"/>Vandu vatangalili vamlakalila, Unyamali lakini mweni awutili nendu, “Mwana wa Dawudi, ung'oneli lusungu!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v"/>Yesu awolukili, kadeta, “Mumkemi.”</para>
  <para style="p">Topi vamkema yula ngalimesu, vamuwombela, “Uyikangashi! Uwoloki akukukema.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v"/>Mweni ayasili ligololi lyaki pambali, ajumbili kamyendela Yesu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v"/>Yesu amdashili, “Ukudayila ngugoleli liki?”</para>
  <para style="p">Yula ngalimesu kamuwombela, “Muwula, nguluva kulola.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v"/>Yesu amuwombilili, “Yendi, kujumila kwaku kukulowola.”</para>
  <para style="p">Bahala pala yula ngalimesu aweshili kulola, amkovikelili Yesu mumwanja.</para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu akwingila Yelusalemu kwa filumbi</para>
  <para style="r">Mateyi 21:1-11, Lukasi 19:28-40, Yohani 12:12-19</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Pavaveghi pabehi na Yelusalemu vafikili Betifage na Betaniya, pabehi na chidunda cha miseituni. Pala Yesu avalayishili vanachuli vaki vavili avalonguleli, <verse number="2" style="v"/>avawombilili, “Muyendi kaya yaveli kuulongolu yenu. Pamyingila kula, bahala pala damuwoni ngwada wa chihongu kakongiwa, akali kugoliwa chichuku na mundu. Mumuwoposoli mumuyeghi. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Kucha mundu pavavadasha, ‘Nongwa liki mukugola naha?’ Mumuwombeli, ‘Bambu akumdayila na tepu damuwuyishi.’ ”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>Topi vayenda, vamwonili ngwada wa chihongu mumbali ya deha kakongiwa pamlyangu. Pavamuwopusoleyi, <verse number="5" style="v"/>vandu vamonga vavelili vawoloka pala vavadashili, “Kwa nongwa liki mkumuwoposola chihongu ayu?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Vanachuli vayangulili kucha Yesu avawombilili, vandu vala vavaleka vanachuli vayendi na chihongu. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Vamuyeghela Yesu ngwada wa chihongu, vayala yingwa shawu kumuwongu ya chihongu na Yesu kakwela kumbindi yaki. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Vandu vatangalili vayala yingwa shawu mudeha, vamonga vayala miputila ya mibiki vadumulili mufitava. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Vandu vosi valongulili na vala vavakovikelili, vadeta kwa lishu likomi, “Tumjumi! Chapanga amunemeli ayu yayisa kwa litawa lya Bambu Chapanga! <verse number="10" style="v"/>Nemeli wutwa ukwisa wa mbuyi wetu Dawudi. Ajumiwi Chapanga avelili kumbindi nendu!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Yesu ayingilili Yelusalemu ayendili mbaka munyumba ya Chapanga, kalola kila chindu kwa unofu. Lijuva lyahongili kala ayendili Betaniya pamu na vala lilongu na vavili.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akulilapila likuyu</para>
  <para style="r">Mateyi 21:18-19</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Chilawu yaki pavafumeyi Betaniya, Yesu aveli na njala. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Topi kwa kutali aliwonili likuyu livelili na mahamba vatangalili. Kaliyendela aloli kucha liveleka. Pafikili kawona liveleka ng'odu lina mihamba hela, chipindi chaki cha kuveleka chavelili chakali. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Bahala pala kaliwombela likuyu, “Kufumila nalelu mbaka jola, mundu yoyosi akotoo kulya fivelekwa fyaku.”</para>
  <para style="p">Vanachuli vaki vakapikanisheyi filongu afi.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akwingila munyumba ya Chapanga</para>
  <para style="r">Mateyi 21:12-17, Lukasi 19:45-48, Yohani 2:13-22</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Vafikili Yelusalemu. Yesu ayingilili munyumba ya Chapanga kakanda kuvavinga vandu vafumi panji vavelili vakuchuusa na kuhemela findu mula. Aghalambulili mesa sha vala vakafunjeyi mbiya na figoda fya vala vavelili vakuchuusa vangunda. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Alemili kumjumisha mundu yoyosi kutola chindu muudamwa wa nyumba ya Chapanga. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Pambeli kavawula, “Yiyandikiwa mumayandiku, ‘Nyumba ya nenga dayikemiwi nyumba ya kudadava kumluva Chapanga kwa vandu va milima yosi!’ Lakini yumwi muyigola kucha mbaku ya vefi!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Vatambika vakomi na vawula va Malawu pavapikanishili afi, vakanda kusaka njila ya kumuwulagha Yesu. Hata naha vamtilili nongwa lipinga lya vandu vayikanganikeyi mawuli vaki.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Lijuva palihongili, Yesu na vanachuli vaki vawuka vayileka mbwani.</para>
  <para style="s">Mawuli kufuma kulikuyu liyumili</para>
  <para style="r">Mateyi 21:20-22</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Pamalavila putiputi, pavapiteyi, valiwonili lila likuyu liyuma kukandila mikigha mbaka kumbindi. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Petili akumbukili, chawombili Yesu, “Muwula, loli! Lila likuyu wulilapilili, liyuma!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Yesu kamuwombela, “Mumjumili Chapanga. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Nguvawombela nakaka, mundu pachiwombela chidunda achi, ‘Tupuki kadubukili mulihiva,’ na pangajila hoshu mundima yaki, topi pajumila kucha chadetili dachifumbuki, dachigoleki kwa mweni. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Ponopa nguvawombela, pamdadava na pamumuluva Chapanga chindu chochosi mjumili mupokela kala davavapi. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Pamdayila kudadava, pomeli kila mundu chila chavavifyili ili tati wenu wa kumbindi avapomeli fimuvifyili.” <verse number="26" style="v"/>Mani pamuvapomela ng'odu vayenu, hata tati wenu yavelili kumbindi dalemi kuvapomela.<note caller="k" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:26 </char><char style="fk">Mani. kuvapomela.</char> Mayandiku vamonga va dayili yivahela msitali wa 26.</note></para>
  <para style="s">Chilongu cha uwesu wa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">Mateyi 21:23-27, Lukasi 20:1-8</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>Topi vayisa kandi Yelusalemu. Yesu payendeyendeyi munyumba ya Chapanga, vatambika vakomi na vawula va Malawu na vavaha vamyendela. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Vamdasha, “Ukugola findu afi kwa uwesu wa ghani? Ghani yakujumishili kugola findu afi?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>Yesu kavawombela, “Danivadashi chindu chimu, pamunyangula na nenga wuwowu danivawombeli ngugola findu afi kwa uwesu wa ghani. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Ghani yamupili Yohani mbatisha uwesu wa kubatisha? Chapanga amupili awu vandu vamupili? Munyanguli.” <verse number="31" style="v"/>Vakandili kuyidasha, “Patudeta, ‘Mani patudeta kufuma kumbindi kwa Chapanga,’ datudashi, ‘Topi mbona mumjumila ng'odu?’ <verse number="32" style="v"/>Pambeli tukuwesha ha kudeta ‘Vamupili vandu.’” Vadetili naha kwanongwa vatila lipinga lya vandu, nongwa vosi vajumilili nakaka Yohani mbatisha aveli mbuyi wa Chapanga. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Topi vamyangula Yesu, “Yufwi tumanya ha.”</para>
  <para style="p">Yesu avawombilili, “Na nenga nivawombeli ng'o kwa uwesu wa ghani ngugola findu afi.”</para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Chilangushilu cha chitava cha misabibu na valimi</para>
  <para style="r">Mateyi 21:33-46, Lukasi 20:9-19</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Yesu akandili kuywanga nawu kwa chilangushilu: “Mundu yumu alimili chitava cha misabibu. Alishengiteshili luviwu na pagati yaki kakumba lyowu lya kukamila misabibu, ajengili na lilingu. pambeli kachihadika chitava chila kwa valimi, mweni ayendili mlima wa kutali.<figure style="fig" desc="" file="04 Winepress.jpg" size="col" loc="" copy="" ref="12:1">Lyowu lya kukamila misabibu</figure> <verse number="2" style="v"/>Chipindi cha kubena, amlayishili ndumindumi waki kwa vala valimi, akamyegheli sehemu ya fyavabenili muchitava chaki. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Vala valimi vamkamula na vamtovanga na vamuwuyisha mawoku hela. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Kamulayisha kandi ndumindumi wingi na ayu vamtesha kumutwi na kumgola wafu. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Yula muna chitava amulayishili ndumindumi wingi kandi, valimi vala ayu vamuwulaya. Avatumili vamonga vatangalili, vamonga vatovangiwa na vamonga vavawulayili. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Asiyalili na mundu yumu, aveli mwana waki amtamili. Pambeli amlayishili ayu kawomba, ‘Davamtili mwana wangu.’ <verse number="7" style="v"/>Lakini vala valimi vawombana, ‘Ayu daghavi muhala mbala, topi tumuwulayi, mbala yaki yivi yetu!’ <verse number="8" style="v"/>Kwa ndambu yila vamkamula na vamuwulaya na kumyasa panji ya chitava chila.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>“Topi, bambu muna chitava dagoli liki? Dayisi kuvawulagha valimi ava na kuvahadisa chitava chila kwa vandu vengi. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Wuli mkali hela kusoma mayandiku yivadeta:</para>
  <para style="q">‘Ligonguveli livalemili vajengi liva ligonguveli likomi lya chikandilu</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Bambu yagolili findu afi,</para>
  <para style="q">fya chiloja nendu kwa yufwi?’ ”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Vatambika vakomi na vawula va Malawu na vavaha vamanyili kucha chilangushilu achi chikwivayilata veni. Vayesha kumkamula lakini vatila lipinga lya vandu, vamuleka, veni vayenda.</para>
  <para style="s">Kuhomba kodi kwa mutwa wa Loma</para>
  <para style="r">Mateyi 22:15-22, Lukasi 20:20-26</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Topi Vafwalisayu na vandu vamonga va chipinga cha mutwa Helodi avalayishili vamuwomeshi Yesu kwa filongu fyaki. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Vamyendilili, vamuwombela, “Muwula tukumanya kucha yuwi kuva mundu yuwudeta nakaka weka, ukumtila ng'odu mundu yoyosi. Wala ukomi wa mundu chindu ng'odu kwa yuwi, lakini ukuwula njila ya nakaka ya Chapanga. Wuli nyanyi kuhomba kodi kwa mutwa wa Loma, awu ng'odu? Tuhombi awu tukotoo kuhomba?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Lakini Yesu amanyili ufyangu wau, kavawombela, “Mbona mukunyesha? Muyeghi ligwala lyeni ndililoli.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Vamuyeghela, vamupa aloli. Na mweni kavadasha, “Wushu na litawa ali lya ghani?”</para>
  <para style="p">Vamyangula, “Ya mutwa wa Loma.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Topi Yesu kavawombela, “Fya mutwa wa Loma mumupi mutwa wa Loma na fya Chapanga mumupi Chapanga.”</para>
  <para style="p">Vamkanganikili nendu.</para>
  <para style="s">Chilongu cha kushukuka kwa vasovili</para>
  <para style="r">Mateyi 22:23-33, Lukasi 20:27-40</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Pambeli vandu vamu va chipinga cha Masadukayu, ava vandu yivawomba yivasovili vakushukuka ng'odu, wamuyendela Yesu, vamdasha. <verse number="19" style="v"/>“Muwula, Musa atugayilili Malawu kucha, ‘Mundu pasova na kuleka mdala angali mwana, mlongu mundu lasima amhali ayu ngalimlyangu, ili amleleli mwana mlongu mundu.’ <verse number="20" style="v"/>Topi kwavelili valongu saba. Wa kwandi atolili mdala, kasova ngajila kuleka mwana. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Mlongu wa pili kamtola yula ngalimlyangu na mweni kasova ngajila kuleka mwana na mlongu wa tatu wuwula wula. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Vosi saba vasova ngajila kuleka mwana. Pambeli yula ngalimlyangu na mweni asovili. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Lijuva palifika vandu vasovili pavashukuka, mau ayu daghavi mdala va ghani? Nongwa vosi saba vamtolili.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>Yesu kavawombela, “Yumwi muvifya mpota liki kumanya Mayandiku vang'alili na liwovi lya Chapanga. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Nongwa vandu pavashukuka davatoli ng'odu wala kutoliwa, davavi kucha makungu wa kumbindi kwa Chapanga. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Wuli, musoma ng'odu chitabu cha Musa, chilongu cha kushukuka kwa vasovili, pachivala pakayakeyi motu? Chapanga amuwombilili Musa ‘Nenga Chapanga wa Ibulahimu na Chapanga wa Isaka na Chapanga wa Yakobi.’ <verse number="27" style="v"/>Topi mweni Chapanga wa vasovili ha, Chapanga wa vavelili vanofu. Yumwi muvifya nendu.”</para>
  <para style="s">Lilawu likomi</para>
  <para style="r">Mateyi 22:34-40, Lukasi 10:25-28</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>Yumu wa muwula va Malawu afikili, kapikanisha malimbanu va Masadukayu na Yesu. Pawonili kucha Yesu kavayangula nyanyi, kafumbuka, kavadasha, “Malawu vosi va Chapanga lyoti liva likomi pitu vosi?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>Yesu kayangula, “Lilawu likomi ndi ali, ‘Isilaeli pikanishi. Bambu Chapanga wetu, Bambu kava mweni weka yaki. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Umtami Bambu Chapanga waku kwa ndima yaku yonda na kwa ngunda yaku yosi na kwa luhala lwaku losi na kwa liwovi lyaku lyosi.’ <verse number="31" style="v"/>Lilawu lya pili litawukili nendu ndi ali, uvatami vandu vamonga kucha pawitama umweni. Kwahela lilawu lingi likomi pitu ali.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>Yula muwula va Malawu kamuwombela “Nyanyi Muwula! Kudeta nakaka kuwomba Chapanga yumu weka hela wala kwahela wingi ila mweni. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Mundu amtami Chapanga kwa moyu wosi, kwa luhala losi na liwovi lyosi na kuvatama vandu vamonga kucha pauyitama mweni. Chindu achi chibalama nendu kwa litambiku lya kunyanya kwa Chapanga.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v"/>Yesu pawonili kucha mundu ayu kamuyangula kwa luhunja amuwombilili, “Yuwi kuva kutali ha na Wutwa wa kumbindi kwa Chapanga.”</para>
  <para style="p">Pambeli, kwahela mundu yayeshili kandi kumdasha chindu.</para>
  <para style="s">Kilistu ghani?</para>
  <para style="r">Mateyi 22:41-46, Lukasi 20:41-44</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v"/>Yesu paghaveyi akuwula munyumba ya Chapanga, kavadasha, “Mbona vawula va Malawu vakudeta kucha Kilistu mkombola mwana wa Dawudi? <verse number="36" style="v"/>Dawudi mweni paghaveyi na Mfuki Mng'alili akumlongosha awombili:</para>
  <para style="q">‘Bambu kamuwombela Bambu wangu:</para>
  <para style="q">Wuyikali mwambu wangu wa mlilu,</para>
  <para style="q">mbaka nivaviki vachimdwama vaku</para>
  <para style="q">pasi ya mawulu vaku.’</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v"/>“Mweni Dawudi akumkema Kilistu Mkombola Bambu. Wuli wuli, Kilistu daghavi mwana wa Dawudi?”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kavafunda vandu kuyilata vawula va Malawu</para>
  <para style="r">Mateyi 23:10-36, Lukasi 20:45-47</para>
  <para style="p">Lipinga lya vandu lyaveli likumpikana Yesu kwa seku. <verse number="38" style="v"/>paghaveyi akuwula, kadeta, “Muyikali mesu na vawula va Malawu veni vakudayilaya kupita vafwala mihabiti mitali na vakujambushiwa kwa hishima na vandu pavapita kusoku. <verse number="39" style="v"/>Kuyikala kufigoda fya kuulongolu munyumba ya kudadavila na kuyikala mufigoda fya nyanyi mulihungu. <verse number="40" style="v"/>Vakuvasulumu nyumba vangalimlyangu kunu vakwilyambishila kudadava sala ndali! Lijuva lya kuhigha davapati asabu ngomi.”</para>
  <para style="s">Fupu ya ngalimlyangu</para>
  <para style="r">Lukasi 21:1-4</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v"/>Yesu aveli kayikala pabehi ya sanduku lya mbiya. Akaloleyi ndambu vandu vatangalili pavayiseyi kutaya mbiya mulisanduku lya mbiya lya Nyumba ya kudadavila. Valundamali vatangalili vatayili mbiya sitangalili. <verse number="42" style="v"/>Pala ayisili mau yumoyu ngalimlyangu mgaju, atayili migwala mivili midokwa ya mbiya. <verse number="43" style="v"/>Pala Yesu avakemili vanachuli vaki, kavawombela, “Nakaka nguvawombela, mau ayu yangajila chindu mgaju kataya mulisanduku lya mbiya chikomi kupita sivatayili vamonga vosi. <verse number="44" style="v"/>Nongwa vamonga vosi vataya shiyongisikili mumali shawu, lakini ayu mau, yaveli mgaju, kataya chavelili nachu chosi, atayili kila chindu chadayileyi mweni kayaki.”</para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu akudeta chilongu cha kubomola Nyumba Ngomi ya Chapanga</para>
  <para style="r">Mateyi 24:1-2, Lukasi 21:5-6</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Yesu pafumeyi munyumba ya Chapanga mwanachuli waki yumu amuwombilili, “Muwula, loli ndambu migonguveli ayi na nyumba asi sivelili sha kuyikang'anika!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v"/>Yesu kamuwombela, “Wuli ukuyiwona nyumba ayi ngomi? Kwa hela hata ligonguweli limu dalisighali kumbindi ya limonga, kila chindu dachibowuliwi.”</para>
  <para style="s">Madaba vakanda</para>
  <para style="r">Mateyi 24:3-14, Lukasi 21:7-19</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>Yesu pavelili kayikala kumbindi ya chidunda cha miseituni akaloleyi kunyumba Ngomi ya Chapanga Petili na Yakobi na Yohani na Andeleya vamdasha paweka, <verse number="4" style="v"/>“Tuwombeli findu afi dafivi ndili? Datuwoni chilangushilu liki kucha milandu ayi yiva pabehi kuwoneka?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Yesu akandili kuvawombela, “Muyikali mesu akotoo kuvapughanya mundu. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Nongwa vatangalili davayisi kwa litawa lyangu, kila mundu dayikemi mweni Kilistu! Ava davavayaghamishi vandu vatangalili. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Pampikanila ngondu na lupwepu lwa ngondu, mukotoo kulilimuka. Findu afi dafiwoneki, hata naha mlima kupela kukali hela kufika. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Vandu va mlima wumu davayiminyi na vandu va mlima wingi, wutwa wumu dauwiminyi na wutwa wingi, Kila mahali dakuwi na chiyighayigha na njala. Findu afi kucha utami wa lihingili lya kulela mwana.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>“Lakini yumwi mugungi mesu. Vandu davavayeghi kuchitemela na kuvatovanga kunyumba sha kudadavila. Davavayeghi kwa vatavala na vatwa kwanongwa ya nenga, ili muvatovileli filongu fya Chapanga. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Na Chilongu cha Nyanyi chikudayiliwa chilanduliwi kwa vandu va milima yosi. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Veni pavavika muchijaka na kuvayegha kuchitemela, mukotoo kutila kucha damdeti liki. Saa yila payifika, mdeti chochosi dampati, nongwa yumwi ha damdeti ila Mfuki Mng'alili. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Mlongu damupi mlongu waki amuwulayi, tati damupi mwana mundu, vana nawu davakang'ali vavaha vawu na kuvawulaya. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Vandu vosi davavanyekwi yumwi nongwa ya litawa lyangu. Lakini yayiwunishila mbaka mwishu ayu dalowuliwi.</para>
  <para style="s">Utatala mkomi</para>
  <para style="r">Mateyi 24:15-28, Lukasi 21:20-24</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>“Pamuwona ‘Uvifyi wafu’ liwolokela mahala paki ng'odu,” Yasoma amanyi mana yaki. Apa vavelili Yudeya vatuvili kufidunda. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Yaveli kumbindi ya lipaghali lya nyumba akotoo kusunuka kuyingila munyumba yaki kutola chindu. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Yaveli kufitava akotoo kuwuya kumbeli kutola yingwa yaki. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Davachiwoni vadadala vaveli na ndumbu na kuyongesha majuva va mbelu! <verse number="18" style="v"/>Dadavi kwa Chapanga findu afi fikotoo kuva chipindi cha lupepu. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Nongwa dakuvi na utatala nendu chipindi achi tukali kuchiwona tangila Chapanga agoli mlima awu mbaka nalelu, wala dayibwituki kandi ha. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Kucha Bambu angapungushili ng'odu majuva ava kwahela mundu angalowuliwili. Lakini kwa vala vaki avashawulili, Bambu kapungusha majuva ava.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>“Topi mundu pavawombela, ‘Mloli, Kilistu kava apa,’ awu ‘kava pala,’ mukotoo kumjumila. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Kwanongwa davawoneki vakina Kilistu wa udesi na vambuyi va udesi, davagoli filangushilu na findu fya filoja, kwa kudayila kuvayaghamisha avashawulili Chapanga kucha pavawesha. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Topi yumwi muvi mesu. Nenga nivawombela findu fyosi fikali kuwoneka.”</para>
  <para style="s">Kuyisa kwa Mwana wa Mundu</para>
  <para style="r">Mateyi 24:29-31, Lukasi 21:25-28</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>“Topi majuva ava pambeli kupita utatala awu, lijuva dalitaywi chisi na mwesi dawumuliki ng'odu. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Ndondwa dasiponeki kufuma kumbindi, mawovi vaveli kumbindi davatikanyiki. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Apa dawoneki Mwana wa Mundu payisa mumafundi kwa liwovi likomi na ukomi waki. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Pambeli davalayi makungu vaki vavakungashi avashawulili kufuma mbembu shosi mchechi sha mlima, kufumila mwambu mbaka mwambu wingi.</para>
  <para style="s">Mawuli va mkuyu</para>
  <para style="r">Mateyi 24:32-35, Lukasi 21:29-33</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>“Kwa likuyu mwiwuli chilangushilu achi. Pamuwona mahamba vaki vakukanda kuva mateki na kutomola vengi, mumanyi chipindi cha ndonya chiva pabehi. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Yumwi wuwowu pamuwona findu afi pafigoleka, mumanyi kucha chipindi chiva pabehi nendu. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Nguvawombela nakaka, chileli achi dachipiti ha ngajila tanila findu afi fyosi kuwoneka. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Kumbindi na mlima dafipiti, lakini chilongu chanenga dachipiti ng'odu.</para>
  <para style="s">Kwahela yamanya lijuva wala saa</para>
  <para style="r">Mateyi 24:36-44</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>“Lakini lijuva na saa liki kwahela mundu amanyili, wala makungu va kumbindi, wala Mwana, ila Tati weka yaki kamanya. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Muvi na chigoyi na muyikali mesu, nongwa chipindi achi mumanya ha pandili dachiyisi. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Dayivi kucha mundu yawuka kayaki kuyenda mwanja, kavalekela ndumindumi vaki ukomi, kila mundu na chichuku chaki, kamuwombela machonda wa kumlyangu ayikali mesu. <verse number="35" style="v"/>Topi mgungi mesu, nongwa mumanya ng'odu mwenikaya akuwuya ndili, pamonga dayivi palumihi awu pamandandu awu putiputi awu pamalavila. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Mgungi mesu kucha payisa tepu akotoo kuvawona muvasha. <verse number="37" style="v"/>Nguvawombela yumwi, nguvawombela vosi: Mgungi mesu!”</para>
  <chapter number="14" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Ndambu ya kumuwulagha Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">Mateyi 26:1-5, Lukasi 22:1-2, Yohani 11:45-53</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Yavelili vasighala majuva mavili hela kufika lihungu lya Pasaka na lihungu lya mibumunda yingali simika. Vatambika vakomi na vawula va Malawu vaveli vakusaka ndambu ya kumkamula Yesu kwa chifisu, ili vamuwulayi. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Vawombili, “Tukotoo kumkamula chipindi cha lihungu, vandu vakotoo kuyisa kugola ndilingu.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu vakumshagha utuli</para>
  <para style="r">Mateyi 26:6-13, Yohani 12:1-8</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>Yesu paghaveyi Betaniya, kayaki Simoni dayili atamikili ukalava. Paghaveyi vakulya, mau yumoyu avelili na supa ya mafuta ya kunungilila na vatalama nendu kayisa, kadiwula supa yila na kumyitila Yesu mafuta vala kumutwi. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Vandu vamu vaveli pala vakalalili, vadeta, “Nongwa liki akuyananga hela mafuta vala? <verse number="5" style="v"/>Angaweshili kuhemesha kwa mbiya siwesha kumuhomba mgola chichuku kwa mwaka wumu awu mbiya ya dinali mya tatu. Na mbiya sila vangavapili vagayu!” Pambeli vamlakalila mau yula.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Lakini Yesu avawombilili, “Mumleki kwanongwa liki mukumuyasha? Kagolela chindu cha nyanyi. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Vagaju muva pamu majuva vosi. Mukuwesha kuvatanga lakini dandivi pamu na yumwi majuva vosi ng'odu. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Mau ayu kagola chaweshili. Kayitilila mafuta mumvili wangu, wuva kala kwa kusikiwa. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Nguvawombela nakaka, kumlima wosi Chilongu cha Nyanyi dachilanduliwi, chindu achi chagolili davachitambuli kwa ngumbungumbu yaki.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yuda akujumila kumshengeta Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">Mateyi 26:14-16, Lukasi 22:3-6</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Pambeli Yudasi Sikaliyoti, yumu wa vala lilongu na vavili, ayendili kwa vatambika vakomi ili kumshengeta Yesu. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Vatambika vakomi pavapikanishili afi, vasekelela, vajangili kumgayila mbiya. Topi Yuda akasakeyi fwasi nofu ya kumshengeta.</para>
  <para style="s">Kutanda filivi fya Pasaka</para>
  <para style="r">Mateyi 26:17-25, Lukasi 22:7-14, 21-23, Yohani 13:21-30</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Lijuva lya kwaa lya lihungu lya mibumunda yingajila kutayiwa simika, chipindi vakuhinja mwana meni wa Pasaka, vanachuli vaki vamdashili, “Ukudayila kulila koti lihugu lya Pasaka?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Topi Yesu avalayishili vanachuli vaki vavili kavawombela, “Muyendi kumbwani na aku damutang'aniki na mlumi yumu kayitwika chiyungu cha machi. Mumukovikeli <verse number="14" style="v"/>mbaka munyumba dayingili, mkamuwombeli muna nyumba, ‘Muwula akudasha, chiva koti chumbagati changu dandilyi lihungu pamu na vanachuli vangu?’ <verse number="15" style="v"/>Mweni davalangushi chumba chikomi kudali chiveli chilembiwa kala muyingili amu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Vanachuli vawuka, vayenda kumbwani, vawona kila chindu chilingana kucha Yesu avawombilili vatandi Lihungu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Payifikili palumihi, Yesu afikili pamu va vanachuli vaki lilongu na vavili. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Pavaveghi pamesa vakulya, Yesu kavawombela, “Nakaka nguvawombela, muyenu yumu ya ghalya pamu na nenga, dashengeti.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Pala vanachuli vaki vakanda kuwona lusungu, vamudasha yumu yumu, “Wuli nengapa?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Yesu kavawombela, “Yumu wa yumwi lilongu na vavili, yalikishila libumunda pamu na nenga muchimbundi. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Nakaka Mwana wa Mundu akuyenda kucha Mayandiku yivawomba. Lakini daachiwoni mundu yula damshengeti Mwana wa Mundu! Ingavelili ngiba mundu ayu kucha angawonikili ng'odu!”</para>
  <para style="s">Filivi fya Bambu</para>
  <para style="r">Mateyi 26:26-30, Lukasi 22:14-20, 1 Vakolindu 11:23-25</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Pavaveghi vakulya, Yesu katola libumunda, kamlumba Chapanga kalimetula na kuvagayila vanachuli vaki padeta, “Mtoli, awu mvili wa nenga.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Kandi atolili lwindi, Kamulumba Chapanga, kavagayila, vosi valandila lwindi lula. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Avawombilili, mwasi awu ukuyitika kwa vandu vatangalili. “Awu mwasi wa nenga kucha paveli mulilaghanu na Chapanga, <verse number="25" style="v"/>Nakaka nguvawombela, danandi kandi ng'odu difwayi mbaka lijuva lila danandi difwayi ya shonu muutwa wa Chapanga.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>Kandi vasomulili lumbombu, vawuka, vayendili kuchidunda cha miseituni.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akutunga dalemiwi na Petili</para>
  <para style="r">Mateyi 26:31-35, Lukasi 22:31-34, Yohani 13:36-38</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>Yesu avawombilili vanachuli vaki, “Mwavosi damuvi na lyogha na nenga, nongwa Mayandiku Vang'alili vadeta, Chapanga damtovi mdima na vameni davamwayiki pwilili. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Lakini pashukuka, dandivalonguleli kula Galilaya.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>Petili amuwombilili, “Mani kucha vosi davakuleki, nenga danikuleki ng'odu!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v"/>Yesu amuwombilili Petili, “Nakaka nguvawombela, pamihi pamu, njowolu akali hela kuvika mwanja wa pili, daunemi myanja mitatu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>Lakini Petili kamuwombela, “Hata sovi pamu na yuwi, danikuleki ng'odu.”</para>
  <para style="p">Vanachuli vosi vadeta wuwula.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akudadava aku Getisemani</para>
  <para style="r">Mateyi 26:35-46, Lukasi 22:39-46</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>Topi vafikili aku kuvakema Getisemani. Yesu avawombilili vanachuli vaki, “Muyikali apa chipindi nenga padadava.” 14:32Getisemani, mana yaki: Chitava chidokwa. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Pambeli avatolili Petili na Yakobi na Yohani, akandili kuyipwelesha nendu na kushushutika. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Avawombilili, “Nguwona lung'ongu lukomi mundima kucha dasovi. Muyikali apa na mugungi mesu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v"/>Ayendili paulongolu padokwa, kayiyasilila pasi wuyifuma, kadadava naha, kucha payiweshikana unewushi payifika saa yila ya kugoboka. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Kadeta, “Aba, Tati wangu, kwa yuwi findu fyosi fikuweshikana ung'ushili lwindi alu, ila yikotoo kuva kucha padayilili nenga, ila ngimu wudayilili yuwi.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v"/>Yesu awuyili kwa vanachuli vaki vatatu, avawonili vawonja. Topi amuwombilili Petili, “Simoni, wuli, ukuwonja? Kulemwa kugunga mesu hata saa yimu?” <verse number="38" style="v"/>Akavawombilili kandi, “Mgungi mesu na kudadava ili mukotoo kuyingila mumutambu wa kuyeshiwa. Mfuki yikudayila lakini mvili ukulemwa.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v"/>Ayendili kandi kudadava akawuyilileyi filongu fifila fila. <verse number="40" style="v"/>Kawuya kandi, avawonili vawonja. Kwanongwa mesu vawu vatopiliwa na ng'onju. Valemwili cha kumyangula.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v"/>Payisili mwanja wa tatu avawombilili, “Mukali muwonja na kupumulila? Ponopa saa yifika! Mwana wa Mundu vakumtawula kwa vandu vavipili. <verse number="42" style="v"/>Muyimuki, tuyendi. Mloli, yula dashengeti kava pabehi.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akuvakuliwa</para>
  <para style="r">Mateyi 26:47-56, Lukasi 22:47-53, Yohani 18:3-12</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v"/>Yesu paghaveyi akali akudeta, Yudasi, muyawu wa vala lilongu na vavili, afikili na lipinga lya vandu vaveli na mimayi na fimbongu. Vandu ava vaveli valayishwa na vatambika vakomi na vawula va Malawu na vavaha. <verse number="44" style="v"/>Yuda avelili kavakupisha: “Yula yinumjambusha na danimunoneli ndi mweni, mumuvakuli na mumuyeghi na mumdimi nendu mumawoku va machonda.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v"/>Yuda pafikili hela, kamyendela Yesu, kamuwombela, “Muwula!” kumunonela. <verse number="46" style="v"/>Topi vala vandu vayisa kumuvakula Yesu, vamuwopa. <verse number="47" style="v"/>Yumu va vala vavelili vawoloka pamu na Yesu, akwemulili limayi lyaki, kamuhenga lijeji ndumindumi wa mtambika mkomi. <verse number="48" style="v"/>Yesu amuwombilili, “Wuli, muyisa na mimayi na fimbongu kungamula, kucha nenga mwifi? <verse number="49" style="v"/>Majuva vosi naveli pamu na yumwi pang'ula munyumba ya Chapanga, mbona mwangamulili ng'odu. Lakini ponopa mayandiku mang'alili vavi.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v"/>Apa vanachuli, vatuvili vosi vamleka.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v"/>Kwavelili na msongolu yumu avelili akumkovekela Yesu kunu kayitanda yingwa ya chikoyi. Veni vayeshili kumkamula. <verse number="52" style="v"/>Lakini mweni kasulubuka, kayileka yila yingwa, katuva chipula.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kuchitemela cha vavaha va Vayawudi</para>
  <para style="r">Mateyi 26:57-68, Lukasi 22:54-55, Lukasi 22:63-71, Yohani 18:13-14, Yohani 18:19-24</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v"/>Topi vamyeghili Yesu kwa mtambika mkomi na vatambika vamonga na vavaha na vawula va Malawu vosi vatanganikili. <verse number="54" style="v"/>Petili amkovikelili Yesu kwa kutali, vayingilili mgati ya luviwu lwa mtambika mkomi, ayikalili pamu na vadima vakayoteyi motu. <verse number="55" style="v"/>Vatambika vakomi na balasa lyosi lya Vayawudi vakasakeyi utovileli kwilata Yesu ili vamuhighi na kumuwulagha, lakini vapatili ng'odu. <verse number="56" style="v"/>Vandu vatangalili vamtovilelili udesi kwa Yesu, lakini utoveleli wau valinganili ha.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v"/>Vamonga vawoloka kandi kumtovelela udesi, vakawombaneyi: <verse number="58" style="v"/>“Yufwi twampikanishili mundu ayu padeta, ‘Dabomoli ayi nyumba ya Chapanga yivajengili kwa mawoku, kwa majuva matatu dajengi yingi yingajila kujengiwa kwa mawoku.’ ” <verse number="59" style="v"/>Hata naha, utovileli wau walinganili ng'odu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v"/>Topi mtambika mkomi awolukili pagati ya vandu. Amdashili Yesu, “Wuli, ukuyangula ng'odu filongu? Vandu ava vakuhimulila liki fikuyilatili yuwi?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v"/>Lakini Yesu anyamalili, ayangulili hata chilongu chimu ha. Mtambika mkomi amdashili kandi, “Wuli yuwi kuva Kilistu, Mwana wa Chapanga ayu yivamjuma?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v"/>Yesu ayangulili, “Yina, nenga mweni. Kandi damung'oni Mwana wa Mundu kayikala mwambu wa mlilu wa Bambu yaveli na liwovi na payisa mumafundi va kumbindi kwa Chapanga.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v"/>Pala mtambika mkomi kademula lihabiti lyaki, kawomba, “Vatovilela va liki kandi? <verse number="64" style="v"/>Mupikanisha, akumujowola Chapanga! Yumwi mukucha wuliwuli?”</para>
  <para style="p">Vosi vamuhigha Yesu awulayiwi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v"/>Topi vamonga vakandili kumtemela mita, vamgubika kuwushu, vamtovanga na kumuwombela, “Tungi ghani kakutova!” Mbaka vandumindumi vamtola na kumtova mbandi.</para>
  <para style="s">Petili kamlema Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">Mateyi 26:69-75, Lukasi 22:56-62, Yohani 18:15-18, Yohani 18:25-27</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v"/>Petili aveli akali pasi ya luviwu, ndumindumi yumu mdala wa mtambika mkomi kayisa. <verse number="67" style="v"/>Pamuwonili Petili payota motu, kamlola! kamuwombela, “Hata yuwi waveli pamu na Yesu wa Nasaleti.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="68" style="v"/>Lakini Petili akanili, kawomba, “Nimumanya ha, wala nguchimanya ng'o chimuwomba!” Pambeli Petili awukili kayenda panji ya luviwu. Pala njowolu kavika.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="69" style="v"/>Yula ndumindumi pamuwonili kandi Petili, akandili kandi kuvawombela vandu vawolukili pala, “Mundu ayu muyawu.” <verse number="70" style="v"/>Petili akanili kandi.</para>
  <para style="p">Pambeli padokwa, vandu vawolukili pala vamuwombilili Petili, “Nakaka yuwi ndi muyawu, nongwa yuwi kuva Mugalilaya.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="71" style="v"/>Lakini Petili akandili kwihongola na kuyilapa padeteyi, “Nenga nimumanya ng'odu mundu ayu yimuwomba womba filongu fyaki.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="72" style="v"/>Bahala pala njowolu kavika mwanja wa pili. Topi Petili kakumbuka ndambu Yesu amuwombilili, “Njowolu akali kuvika mwanja wa pili, daunemi myanja mitatu.” Petili alilili.</para>
  <chapter number="15" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu akuyeghiwa kubalasa lya Pilatu</para>
  <para style="r">Mateyi 27:1-2, Mateyi 27:11-14, Lukasi 23:1-5, Yohani 18:28-38</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Pamalavila puti, vatambika vakomi vatanganili pamu na vavaha na vawula va Malawu na vandu va balasa lyosi, vapatanili kumuyegha Yesu kuchitemela cha Pilatu. Vamuwopa na pingu, vamyegha na kumuhadisha kwa Pilatu. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Pilatu kamdasha Yesu, “Wuli yuwi kuva mutwa wa Vayawudi?”</para>
  <para style="p">Yesu kamyangula, “Yina, yiva ngimu wudetili.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>Vatambika vakomi vamuhigha Yesu kwa findu fitangalili. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Pilatu kamdasha kandi Yesu, “Wuli ukuyangula chindu ng'odu? Pikanishi fyosi fivakutovelela yuwi!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Lakini Yesu ayangulili chindu ha, Pilatu kayikanganika nendu.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akuhighiwa njifwa</para>
  <para style="r">Mateyi 27:15-26, Lukasi 23:13-25, Yohani 18:39-19:16</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Kila lihungu lya Pasaka, Pilatu aveli na chishovi cha kumulekishela mundu yumu yaveli muchijaka, yivamdayilili vandu. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Chipindi achi, kwavelili na mundu yumu yakemiwa Balaba. Ayu aveli kawopiwa muchijaka pamu na vandu vamonga vawulayili vandu pakaveyi mundilingu. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Vandu vatangalili vamyendela Pilatu na kumluva avagoleli kucha chishovi chaki. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Pilatu kavadasha, “Wuli nivalekesheleli Mutwa wa Vayawudi?” <verse number="10" style="v"/>Pilatu awombili naha kwanongwa amanyili ngatu hela kucha vatambika vakomi vamyeghili Yesu kwa mweni kwanongwa vamuwonela weyi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Lakini vatambika vakomi vavatumishila vandu vamluvi Pilatu avalekesheleli Balaba. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Pilatu avadashili kandi, “Ponopa mkudayila ndimgoli liki mundu ayu yumumkema Mutwa wa Vayawudi?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Vadeta kwa lishu likomi, “Mumvangilili mulupingika!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Pilatu kavadasha, “Kagola chindu liki cha wafu?”</para>
  <para style="p">Lakini veni vayendilela kudeta kwa lishu likomi, “Mumvangilili mulupingika!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Pilatu akadayileyi kulinowesha lila lipinga lya vandu, topi kavagayila Balaba kufuma muchijaka. Kalayishila Yesu alatuliwi fiboku, pambeli avangiliwi mulupingika.</para>
  <para style="s">Machonda vakumdanila Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">Mateyi 27:27-31, Yohani 19:2-3</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Pambeli machonda vamuyeghili Yesu mgati ya liboma lya Pilatu mkomi wa mlima na vavakema vayawu vosi. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Vamfwalishili yingwa ya langi ya sambalawu, vapota likokoma lya misomi na valivika kumutwi yaki. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Pambeli vakanda kumjambusha, “Hasi Mutwa wa Vayawudi!” <verse number="19" style="v"/>Vayendelela kumtova kwa lidengi kumutwi na kumtemela mita. Pambeli vamtundamila na kumgondamila. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Pavamdanilili kala, vamuwopusolili lila lihabiti lya langi ya sambalawu, vamfwalisha yingwa shaki. Pambeli vamyegha panji ili vamvangilili mulupingika.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akuvangiliwa mulupingika</para>
  <para style="r">Mateyi 27:32-44, Lukasi 23:26-43, Yohani 19:17-27</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Pavaveghi munjila, vatanganikili na mundu yumu yakemiwa Simoni, mundu wa mlima wa Kileni, tati wawu Alekisanda na Lufu. Mundu ayu avelili akufuma kuchijiji, akuyenda kumbwani. Machonda vamung'ang'anika avagali lupingika lwa Yesu. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Pambeli vamyegha Yesu mbaka mahali pakemiwa Goligota, mana yaki, “Mahali pa lipava lya mutwi.” <verse number="23" style="v"/>Vamugayila difwayi yivahashili na mtela wuvakema manimani, lakini mweni kalema kuyilanda. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Pambeli vamvangilila mulupingika na vavaghana yingwa shaki kwa kugola do kulamula ghani apati yingwa liki. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Yavelili saa tatu pamalavila Yesu pavamvangilileyi mulupingika. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Vayandika muchibawu fyavifyili naha: “Mutwa wa Vayawudi”. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Pambeli Yesu vamvangililili mulupingika pamu na vefi vavili, yumu mwambu waki wa mlilu na wingi mwambu waki wa kumkiyi. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Ndambu ayi, Mayandiku vava vadetili, “Avikiwili pamu na lipinga lya vandu vawafu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>Vandu vavelili vakupita pala vatikanya mitwi yawu na kumjowola Yesu, pavadeta, “Aka! Yuwi muna uwesu wa kubowola nyumba ya Chapanga na kuyigola kwa majuva matatu! <verse number="30" style="v"/>Ponopa sunuki mulupingika na wilowoli umweni!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>Wuwula wula vatambika vakomi na vawula va Malawu vamdanila pavadeta veni kwa veni, “Avalowulili vamonga, lakini kalemwa kuyilowola mweni! <verse number="32" style="v"/>Ayu Kilistu, mutwa va Isilaeli! Topi asunuki kufuma mulupingika na yufwi datumjumili!”</para>
  <para style="p">Na hata vandu vala vavangiliwi mumipingika pamu na mweni vamjowulili.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akusova mulupingika</para>
  <para style="r">Mateyi 27:45-56, Lukasi 23:44-49, Yohani 19:28-30</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v"/>Kufumila saa sita pamusi, mlima wonda ugubikiwili na chisi chayikalili mbaka saa tisa. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Payifikili saa tisa pamusi, Yesu kalila kwa lishu likomi, “Eloi, Eloi, lama Sabakitani?” Mana yaki, “Chapanga wangu, Chapanga wangu, mbona kuneka?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v"/>Vandu vamonga vawolukili pala pavapikanishili naha, vadeta, “Pikanishi, akumkema Eliya!” <verse number="36" style="v"/>Mundu yumu katuva, kajabika lindelindeli musiki, kalisobeka muludengi na kumupa Yesu alandi. Pambeli kadeta, “Leki tuloli kucha Eliya dayisi kumsunusha mulupingika!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v"/>Yesu kawuta kwa lishu likomi, pambeli kasova.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v"/>Lupayi lwa nyumba ya Chapanga lwademukili filepa fivili kufumila kumbindi mbaka pasi. <verse number="39" style="v"/>Na mkomi va machonda yavelili kawoloka paulongolu pa lupingika pawonili ndambu Yesu pasovili, kadeta, “Nakaka mundu ayu avelili Mwana wa Chapanga!” <verse number="40" style="v"/>Kwavelili na vadadala vamonga vavelili pavalola kwa kutali. Vamu vaveli Maliya Magadalena na Maliya mawu wawu akina Yakobi mdokwa na Yose na Salomi. <verse number="41" style="v"/>Yesu paghaveyi Galilaya, vadadala ava vamkovikelili na kumtanga. Wuwowu vadadala vamonga vatangalili yivayisili pamu na mweni Yelusalemu vaveli bahala.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akusikiwa</para>
  <para style="r">Mateyi 27:57-61, Lukasi 23:50-56, Yohani 19:38-42</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v"/>Yaveli palumihi ya Lijuva lya Kuyitalisha kwa Lijuva lya Kupumulila. <verse number="43" style="v"/>Yosefu mwenikaya wa Alimataya, mundu wa balasa lya Vayawudi na yapikanishiwili nendu kafika. Mundu ayu aveli akuuvetela Wutwa wa kumbindi kwa Chapanga. Topi kamyendela Pilatu ngajila kukangajila, kamluva amupi chikongu cha Yesu. <verse number="44" style="v"/>Pilatu kayikanganika papikanishili kucha Yesu aveli kasova kala. Topi kamkema mkomi wa machonda, kamdasha kucha Yesu kasova kala. <verse number="45" style="v"/>Pawombiwili na yula mkomi wa machonda Yesu kasova kala, amjumishili Yosefu atoli chikongu cha Yesu. <verse number="46" style="v"/>Yosefu kahemela ligubiku, kasunusha chikongu cha Yesu na kaushengiteshela ligubiku kauvika musembi yisonguliwili muligangachuma. Pambeli kabilibisha ligangachuma likomi pamlyangu ya sembi. <verse number="47" style="v"/>Maliya Magadalena na Maliya mau waki Yose vapawonili pala pavikiwili chikongu cha Yesu.</para>
  <chapter number="16" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Kushukuka kwa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">Mateyi 28:1-8, Lukasi 24:1-12, Yohani 20:1-10</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Lijuva lya Kupumulila palipelili, Maliya Magadalena na Maliya mau waki Yakobi na Salomi vahemela mafuta va kunungilila ili vakaushaghi mvili wa Yesu. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Topi lijuva lya kupumulila <note caller="n" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16:2 </char><char style="fk">Jumapili:</char> Kwa Chigiliki kupumulila lijuva lya kwaa lya juma.</note> lijuva palisosomokeyi, vayenda kusembi. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Pavaveghi mudeha, vakawombaneyi, “Ndi datubilibishili lila ligangachuma likomi pamlyangu wa sembi?” <verse number="4" style="v"/>Lakini pavalolili, valiwona ligangachuma lila likomi libilibishiwa kala. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Topi vayingila musembi, vamuwona mundu yafwalili yingwa yiveli mbuleteee, kayikala kumlilu. Chivakola chipwembwi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Mundu yula kavawombela, “Mkotoo kutila, manya mukumsaka Yesu wa Nasaleti yavangiliwili mulupingika. Kava baha ng'odu, kashukuka! Mloli mahali pavamvikili. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Ponopa muyendi mukavawombeli vanachuli vaki pamu na Petili kucha, ‘Yesu akuvalongulela Galilaya. Aku damumuwoni kucha pavawombilili.’ ” <verse number="8" style="v"/>Topi, vafuma kula kusembi luvilu, kunu pavabagama na kuyikang'anika. Vamuwombela ha mundu yoyosi chindu achi kwanongwa vatilili munu.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akumfumbukila Maliya Magadalena</para>
  <para style="r">Mateyi 28:9-10, Yohani 20:11-18</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Yesu pashukukili lijuva lya kupumulila pamalavila puti, amfumbukilili tanila Maliya Magadalena, yula yafumishiwili finyamkela saba na Yesu. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Mweni kayenda kuvawombela vala vavelili pamu na Yesu na chipindi achi vavelili vakali pavalila na kudadava. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Lakini pavapikanishili kucha Yesu kashukuka na Maliya Magadalena kamuwona, vajumilili ng'odu.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akuvafumbukila vanachuli vavili</para>
  <para style="r">Lukasi 24:13-35</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Pambeli Yesu avafumbukilili vanachuli vaki vavili kwa ndambu yingi. Vanachuli ava vaveli vakuyenda kufijiji. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Na veni vawuya na kuvawombela vayawu. Lakini vayawu wuwula vajumila ng'odu.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akuvafumbukila vanachuli lilongu na yumu</para>
  <para style="r">Mateyi 28:16-20, Lukasi 24:36-49, Yohani 20:19-23, Figoli 1:6-8</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Pambeli Yesu kavafumbukila vanachuli vaki lilongu na yumu pavaveghi vakulya. Kavalakalila kwanongwa vaveli vahela ujumilwa na wuwula kwanongwa ndima shawu vawu shadindalili kuvajumila vandu vala vamuwonili pashukukili. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Kavawombela, “Muyendi kumlima wosi mukalanduli Chilongu cha Nyanyi kwa kila mundu. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Mundu yoyosi yajumila na kabatishiwa, dalowuliwi, lakini mundu yoyosi yangajila kujumila, dahighiwi. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Na filangushilu afi dafivi pamu na vala vajumila, Kwa litawa lyangu davafumishi finyamkela na davadeti kwa ng'ombelu ya shonu. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Pavakamula njoka awu pavalanda chindu chiveli na sumu, dachivagoli chindu ng'odu. Davaviki mawoku vawu kumbindi ya vatami na veni davanani.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu katoliwa kumbindi kwa Chapanga</para>
  <para style="r">Lukasi 24:50-53, Figoli 1:9-11</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Bambu Yesu pamalilili kudeta na vanachuli vaki, katoliwa kumbindi kwa Chapanga na kayikala mwambu wa mlilu wa Chapanga. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Pambeli vanachuli vayenda kila mahali kulandula Chilongu cha Nyanyi. Bambu agolili pamu na veni na alangushili kucha milandu yawu yaveli nakaka kwa filangushilu fiyikolili nawu.</para>
</usx>
